<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">Gamlah Vana</book>
  <para style="h">Gamlah Vana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Gamlah Vana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Gamlah Vana</para>
  <para style="mt">Gamlah Vana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate, Egypt gam pan a pei zaw uh a kum nina, a hla nina a ni masa ni-in, Sinai senel gam kikhopna puonbuh sungah Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mihon buppi, a be a phung sung vuah pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin pasal poma a milipin a phaza sim in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel sungah kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding mi poma a phaza sim in. Nang le Aaron in a pawlpawlin a min uh na khum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A minam ciet panin pasal khat ciet, a pupa innkuon lutang pen ciet in ang hu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note ang hu dingte’ min tam teng ahi hi: Reuben panin, Shedeur’ tapa Elizur;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Simeon panin, Zurishaddai’ tapa Shelumiel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah panin, Amminadab’ tapa Nahshon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Issachar panin, Zuar’ tapa Nethanel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zebulun panin, Helon’ tapa Eliab;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joseph’ tapate: Ephraim panin, Ammihud’ tapa Elishama; Manasseh panin, Pedahzur’ tapa Gamaliel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Benjamin panin, Gideoni’ tapa Abidan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan panin, Ammishaddai’ tapa Ahiezer;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asher panin, Ochran’ tapa Pagiel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gad panin, Deuel’ tapa Eliasaph;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naphtali panin, Enan’ tapa Ahira ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam teng pen mihonpi sung pana a kiteel amau’ be lutangte, a pawlpawla a kikhen Israel-te lutangte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Moses le Aaron in a min kilosa tam mite a zawpi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a hla nina, a ni masa ni-in Israel mihonte a kaikhawm uhi. Amate in a be sung vuah a pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pana tungsie mite’ min a khum vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin ama in Sinai senel gamah amate a phaza a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel’ tapa tapen Reuben’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Reuben’ minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmli le tulguh le zanga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Simeon’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Simeon’ minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmnga le tulkuo le zathum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gad’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gad minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmli le tulnga le zaguh sawmnga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Judah’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan thum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmsagi le tulli le zaguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Issachar’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah a pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isaachar’ minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmnga le tulli le zali ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zebulun’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zebulun’ minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmnga le tulsagi le zali ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Joseph’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Joseph’ minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmli le zanga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Manasseh’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Manasseh’ minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmthum le tul ni le zani ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Benjamin’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Benjamin’ minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmthum le tul nga le zali ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dan’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Dan’ minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmguh le tul ni le zasagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Asher’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Asher’ minam lahah a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmli le tulkhat le zanga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Naphtali’ suonlehlahte panin amau’ pienna gui, amau’ be sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a min om bangin a milipin kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan tum thei ding pasal poma:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Naphtali’ minam lahah a a kiciemte mi phaza pen tul sawmnga le tul thum le zali ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tam teng pen Israel’ makai sawm le nite panpina tawh Moses le Aaron in amau’ innkuon ciet tanga a na sim uh mite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel gam sungah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a kum sawmni pan a tungsie paltan kuon thei ding Israel-te mi phaza buppi-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />tul zaguh le tulthum le zanga le sawmnga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hinanle amau’ pupa minam min zui-in Levi-te pen amate tawh kisimton lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah a gen zo hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Levi minamte beh na ciemte sih ding a, amate pen adang Israel-te tawh na simton sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Thuciemna biehbuh le a sunga vanzah zosie, le tua tawh kisai na zosie a uh dingin Levi-te na sezaw ding hi; amate in biehbuh le a sunga vanzah zosie puo-in biehbuh kemcingin, biehbuh kimvelah phuol sat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Biehbuh a kituo ding ciengin Levi-te in a phet ding uhi; biehbuh a kilam ding ciengin zong Levi-te ma in lam ding uhi. A kunga a pei a pulam mi khat popo kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Adang Israel-te pen amau’ galphuol cietah a pawlpawlin phuol sat ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />hinanle Israel mihonpite tungah lungthahna a tun lo nadingin Levi-te in thuciemna biehbuh kimkotah phuolsat ding uhi; tuale Levi-te in thuciemna biehbuh cin ding tavuon la ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tua bangin Israel-te a gamta uhi; amate in Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-te in amau’ dielkhai nei cietah amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in giephuol a sat ding uhi; amate in a pang simah kikhopna puonbuh lam mai ngatin phuol sat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nisuona lampangah nisuo lam nga-in a pawlpawla giephuol sat dingte pen Judah pawlte hi ding uhi. Judah mite’ makai pen Amminadab’ tapa Nahshon hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmsagi le tulli le zaguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama zomah phuolsat ding pen Issachar minam hi ding hi. Issachar minam makai pen Zuar’ tapa Nethanel hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmnga le tulli le zali ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Zebulun minam hi ding hi: Zebulun minam makai pen Helon’ tapa Eliab hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama pawl miphaza pen tul sawmnga le tulsagi le zali ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah’ giephuolah a pawlpawla omte pen a unpi-in tulza le tul sawmgiet le tulguh le zali pha hi. A kipei ciengin amate masa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leitaw lampangah a pawlpawla giephuol sat ding pen Reuben pawlte hi ding hi. Reuben minam makai pen Shedeur’ tapa Elizur hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmli le tulguh le zanga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama zomah phuol sat ding pen Simeon’ minam hi ding hi. Simeon minam makai pen Zurishaddai’ tapa Shelumiel hi ding hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ama’ pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmnga le tulkuo le zathum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gad minam hi ding hi: Gad minam makai pen Reuel’ tapa Eliasaph hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ama’ pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmli le tulnga le zaguh le sawmnga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Reuben’ giephuolah a pawlpawla a omte pen a unpi-in tulza le tul sawmnga le tulkhat le zali le sawmnga pha hi. A nina-ah amate pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kikhopna buh pen giephuol’ laikima om Levi-te’ giephuol tawh peiton ding hi; a phuolsat hun lai ma bangun amau’ mun cietah a dielkhai ciet utawh pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nitumna lampangah a pawlpawla giephuol sat ding pen Ephraim pawlte hi ding hi. Ephraim minam makai pen Ammihud’ tapa Elishama hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ama’ pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmli le zanga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama zomah Manasseh minam hi ding hi. Manasseh minam makai pen Pedahzur’ tapa Gamaliel hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ama’ pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmthum le tulni le zani ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Benjamin minam hi ding hi: Benjamin minam makai pen Gideoni’ tapa Abidan hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ama’ pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmthum le tulnga le zali ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ephraim’ giephuolah a pawlpawla a omte pen a unpi-in tulza le tulgiet le zakhat pha hi. A thumna-ah amate pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Leilu lampangah a pawlpawla giephuol sat ding pen Dan pawlte hi ding hi. Dan minam makai pen Ammishaddai’ tapa Ahiezer hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ama’ pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmguh le tulni le zasagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama zomah phuol sat ding pen Asher minam hi ding hi. Asher minam makai pen Ochran’ tapa Pagiel hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ama’ pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmli le tulkhat le zanga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Naphtali minam hi ding hi: Naphtali minam makai pen Enan’ tapa Ahira hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ama’ pawl mi phaza pen tul sawmnga le tulthum le zali ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Dan’ giephuolah a pawlpawla a omte pen a unpi-in tulza le tul sawmnga le tulsagi le zaguh pha hi. Amate pen a pawlpawlin a nukhia penin pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tam pen amau’ pupa innkuon zui-a kisim Israel-te ahi vua, giephuolah a pawlpawla a om mimal buppi pen tul zaguh le tulthum le zanga le sawmnga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin Israel-te lahah Levi-te kisimton lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin Israel-te gamta uhi. Amate in a galkap honpite tawh giephuol a sat vua, mi zosie in a be le a pupa innkuon zui-in tua bang ma-in a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam pen Topa in Sinai Muol tungah Moses a hopi lai-a Aaron le Moses’ pienna guite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam teng pen Aaron tapate’ min ahi hi: A tapa tapen Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, le Ithamar ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tam teng pen siempu sathau kinusa, siempu na sem dinga kisudetsa Aaron tapate’ min ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sinai senel gam Topa mai-ah mei siengtho lo a pieh ciengun Topa mai-ah Nadab le Abihu a si vua, ama gel in ta a nei sih uhi. A pa uh Aaron hin sungin Eleazar le Ithamar in siempu sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Levi minamte a nai-ah peipi inlen, amate in siempu Aaron a hu thei nadingin a mai-ah koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biehbuhah a sep ciengun ama le a kikhawm mihon buppi adingin kikhopna buh mai-ah amate in na a sem ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />amate in kikhopna buh vanzah zosie a vaan ding vua, biehbuh-ah a sep ciengun Israel-te’ nasep ding teng sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma in Aaron le a tapate tungah Levi-te na pie ding hi; amate pen Israel-te lah panin ama tunga kipumpieh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin nangma in Aaron le a suon a hlahte’ min na khum ding hi; amate pen siempu’ na sem dingte ahi vua, amate kunga a pei a pulam mi khatpopo kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-te lahah naubu hong tacil zosie tang dingin keima in Israel-te lahah Levi-te ka sang hi. Levi-te pen keima-a’ hi ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />azieh pen tacil zosie keima-a’ ahi hi. Egypt gam sungah tacil zosie ka thagam lai-in, Israel sunga tacil zosie, mihingte le ganhingte a ni-in keima adingin ka siensuo hi; amate pen keima-a’ hi ding hi. Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Sinai senel gamah Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi-te, a pupa’ innkuonkuon le a bebe-in sim in. Hla khat pan a tungsie pasal poma na sim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama thu a kipieh bangin Topa’ kammal tawh kizui-in Moses in amate a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Levi tapate’ min pen: Gershon, Kohath, le Merari ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Gershon tapate’ min pen: Libni le Shimei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Kohath’ tapate min pen: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Merari’ tapate min pen: Mahli le Mushi ahi hi. Tam teng pen amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in Levi-te’ bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Libni mite le Shimei mite pen Gershon-te’ be ahi uhi; tam teng pen Gershon-te’ bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate, hla khat panin a tungsie pasal zosie a kisimna-ah tulsagi le zanga a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gershon-te be in nitumna lam biehbuh nua-ah giephuol a sat ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gershon-te’ pupa innkuon lutang pen Lael’ tapa Eliasaph ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh sunga Gershon tapate’ nasep pen a biehbuh, puonbuh a tuomna tawh, kikhopna puonbuh lutna puonkhai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />buhtuol puon kikhaite, biehbuh le maitam kimvela om buhtuol lutna puonkhai, le khauhuolte le tuate tawh kisai nasep zosie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kohath-te be pen Aram-te, Izhar-te, Hebron-te, le Uzziel-te ahi hi; tam teng pen Kohath-te’ be ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hla khat le a tungsie pasal zosie, biehbuh nasep a sem poma a kisimna-ah tulgiet le zaguh a pha vua, amate in mun siengtho cin ding tavuon nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kohath-te’ be in biehbuh leitaw lamah giephuol a sat ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kohath-te’ bete sung panin a pupa innkuon lutang pen Uzziel’ tapa Elizaphan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amau’ nasep dingte pen thuciemna singkuong, sabuoi, meivah tunna, maitamte, mun siengtho sunga siempupa nasepna vanzahte, kidalna puonkhai le tam teng tawh a kisai nasep zosie van ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Siempu Aaron’ tapa Eleazar pen Levi makaite tungah a uhpi pa hi ding a, mun siengtho cing dinga kikoi mite’ nasepna vil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mahli-te le Mushi-te pen Merari-te’ be ahi uhi: Tam teng pen Merari-te’ be ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hla khat panin a tungsie a kisim pasal poma tulguh le zani ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Merari’ bete lahah a pupa innkuon lutang pen Abihail’ tapa Zuriel ahi hi; amate in biehbuh leilu lampangah giephuol sat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Merari’ tapate et dinga kise nasep ahile biehbuh khuompehte, a zawlte, a khuompite, a tunnate, a nengthem zosie le tua teng tawh kisai nasep zosie ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />a buhtuol kimvela khuompite, a tunnate, khetphimte, le a khaute tawh zong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nisuona lampang biehbuh mai, nisuona maingatin kikhopna puonbuh mai-ah giephuol sat dingte pen mun siengtho sungah Israel-te dinga bang khat popo a seppieh dingte ahi Moses, Aaron le Aaron’ tapate ahi uhi; a nai-a pei a pulam mi popo kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Moses le Aaron in Topa’ thupiehna tawh amau’ be zui-in a sim uh hla khat le a tungsie Levi-te pasal zosie tul sawmni le tulni pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin a gen hi: Israel-te lahah hla khat pan a tungsie tacil pasal zosie’ min ciemte inlen amau’ min sim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel-te lahah tacil zosie tang dingin keima dingin Levi-te nei sanpieh ding a, Israel-te’ ganhonte lahah tacil zosie tang dingin Levi-te’ ganhonte nei sanpieh ding hi- keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in ama a thupieh bangin Moses in Israel-te lahah tacil zosie’ min ciemte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A min kiciemte, a kisim hla khat panin a tungsie tacil pasal zosie tul sawmni le tulni le zani le sawmsagi le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Israel-te lahah tacil zosie tang dingin Levi-te sang inlen, amau’ ganhonte tang dingin Levi-te’ ganhonte sang in. Levi-te pen keima-a’ ahi hi. Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Levi-te sangin zani le sawmsagi le thumin a tamzaw Israel tacilte kitat manh dingin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />mun siengtho shekel tena tawh kizui-in shekel khatah gerah sawmni a pha shekel nga na sang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A tamzawte kitatna sum pen Aaron le a tapate tungah pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuaci’n Levi-te in a tat uh a tamzawte kitatna sum pen Moses in la hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />ama in mun siengtho shekel tena tawh kizui-in tulkhat le zathum le sawmguh le nga a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Topa’ thugen tawh zui-in Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin tatna sumte Moses in Aaron le a tapate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Levi-te lah panin Kohath-te khenkhie inlen amau’ be le amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kikhopna buh tawh kisai na a sem thei ding kum sawmthum pan kum sawmnga a pha mi zosie sim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kohath-te in kikhopna buh sungah a siengtho pen nate tawh kisai nasepte sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Giephuol a kituon ding ciengin a sungah Aaron le a tapate lutin kidalna puon a la ding vua, tua puon tawh thuciemna singkuong khu ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua ciengin savun hoi tawh a tuom ding vua, tua tungah amate in puondum khu-in a zawlte hlung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ompina anlum sabuoi tungah puondum a pha ding vua, tua tungah kuongdaite, gimnamtui pakante, kuongkumte, le tuibuoh nading thawlte a koi ding uhi; tua tunga om den ding anlum zong kikoi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua ciengin amate in puon-ausan khat tawh tuate a khu ding vua, savun hoi tawh tuomin a zawn nadingin zawlte a bilah bul ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in puon a dum khat a la ding vua, meivah khuom pen, a meivahte, a taite-te, a kuongte, le sathau koina vanzah zosie tawh khu ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuale amate in vanzah zosie zong savun hoi tawh tuomin a zawnna ding tal tungah khang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in kham maitam tungah puondum khat a pha ding vua, savun hoi tawh tuomin a zawlte a bul ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuale mun siengtho sunga kizang vanzah zosie la-in puondum khatah tunin savun tawh a tuom ding vua, a zawnna ding tal tungah a khang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in maitam tunga vutte luohin a tungah puon a dupsan khat pha ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuale amate in nasepna dinga kizang maitam vanzah zosie, vut luonate, tawkeu-kate, kawbiate, le kuongte, maitam vanzah zosiete a tungah koi-in tua tungah savun hoi tawh tuomin a zawlte bul ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate in mun siengtho le mun siengtho vanzah zosie a khu zaw uh giephuol a tuon ciengun tuate a puo dingin Kohath mite a pei ding vua, ahi vangin amate in a siengtho nate a tham sih ding uhi. A tham khah uleh a si ding uhi. Tam teng pen Kohath-te puoh ding kikhopna puonbuh nate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siempu Aaron’ tapa Eleazar in meivah tui, gimnamtuite, a hunhuna kipie an tawh biehna, nu sathaute, biehbuh buppi le a sunga om na zosie, mun siengtho le a sunga a vanzah zosie enin vil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses le Aaron hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Levi-te lah panin Kohath-te’ bete na susie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A siengtho pen nate kungah a pei ciengun si loin a hin nadingun amate hicisah in: Aaron le a tapate a sungah lutin amau’ sep ding le a puoh ding ciet uh se ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hizongle a siengtho nate en dingin a sungah Kohath-te bakhat sung nangawn a tum sih ding uhi; a tum uleh si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gershon-te zong, amau’ pupa innkuon le a be zui-in sim in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />kikhopna buh sungah na sem thei ding kum sawmthum pan kum sawmnga a pha mite a min na khum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam pen Gershon bete’ nasep le a van puoh ding uh ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in biehbuh dalna puonte, kikhopna puonbuh le a tuomna tawh, tua tungah a pulam khuna savun hoi, kikhopna buh kotkhah puonkhai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />le buhtuol puon kikhaite, biehbuh le maitam kimvela om buhtuol lutna puonkhai, a khauhuolte, le amau’ nasep nadinga vanzah zosie a puo ding uhi; amate in tua teng tawh kisai nasep a kisam zosie sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gershon-te’ nasepna zosie, a puoh ding teng zosie uh, a sep ding teng zosie uh, Aaron le a tapate’ thupiehna bang hi ding hi; a puoh ding zosie ule a bawl ding zosie uh amate na ap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam pen kikhopna buh tawh kisai Gershon bete’ nasep ahi a, amau’ nasepna teng pen siempu Aaron’ tapa Ithamar’ uhna nei-ah om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Merari-te, amau’ be le amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />biehbuh sunga na sem thei ding kum sawmthum pan kum sawmnga cieng a pha mi zosie a min na khum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam pen kikhopna buh sungah a sep ding zosie uh ahi hi: Biehbuh khuompehte, a zawlte, a khuompite, le a khuom tunnate tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />buhtuol kimvela om khuompite a tunnate tawh, a khetphimte, a khauhuolte, vanzah zosie le , amau’ nasepna tawh kizom na zosie ahi hi; amau’ puoh dinga kise vante a minin na lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tam teng pen Merari bete nasep ding hi a, siempu Aaron’ tapa Ithamar khut nei-ah kikhopna puonbuh tawh kisai a sep ding zosie uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses, Aaron le mihon makaite in amau’ be le amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in Kohath-te a min a khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh tawh kisai na a sem thei ding kum sawmthum pan sawmnga a pha mi zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />amau’ be zui-in a min kikhum pen tulni za sagi le sawmnga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tam teng pen kikhopna puonbuh sunga nasem Kohath-te be zosie’ mi phaza kisimna hi a, Moses tungtawnin Topa in thu a pieh bangin Moses le Aaron in min a khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Gershon-te, amau’ be le amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in a min uh kikhum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />kikhopna puonbuh sunga na a sem thei ding kum sawmthum pan kum sawmnga a pha mi zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />amau’ be le amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in a min kikhum mi tulni zaguh le sawmthum pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tam teng pen Moses le Aaron in Topa’ thupiehna tawh kizui-in kikhopna puonbuh sunga na a sem thei ding Gershon-bete’ min kikhumna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Merari-te, amau’ be le amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in kisim a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />kikhopna puonbuh sunga na a sem thei ding mi zosie-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />amau’ be zui-in a min a kikhum mi tulthum zani pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tam pen Moses tungtawnin Topa’ thupiehna tawh kizui-in Moses le Aaron in min a khum Merari bete mi phaza ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amau’ be le amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in Moses, Aaron, le Israel makaite in a min a khum Levi-te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />kikhopna puonbuh tawh kisai na sem thei ding le van a puo thei ding kum sawmthum pan kum sawmnga a pha mi zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />amau’ mimal kisim pen tulgiet le zanga le sawmgiet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Moses tung tawna Topa’ thupiehna tawh kizui-in a sep ding a puoh ding ciet uh kise hi; Topa in Moses a thupiehna tawh kizui-in ama in tua bangin amau’ min a khum hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in miphahte, ahi sihle nin neite le misi tawh kisuhkhah zieha abua mi poma giephuol pulamah a nawmang nadingun Israel-te thu pie in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate lahah ka tenna a giephuol uh a niehsah lo nadingun amate, pasal ahi a, numei ahi zongin giephuol pulamah na notmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ma bangin Israel-te in a bawl vua, giephuol pulamah amate a notmang uhi; Topa thupieh bangin Israel mite gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel-te kungah tam bangin gen in: Midang khat tungah pasal khat ahi sihle numei khat a tatkhiel a, Topa tungah muonhuoi loin khielna a bawl ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a gamtatnasa mawna pulah ding hi. A tatkhielna a cingin lokia ding a, ama in tua tungah nga-ah-khat belapin a tatkhielna pa kungah pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A liem mipa in khielna zieha lokiana a sang ding a kinaipi tanau a nei sih leh, tua khielna zieha lokiana pen Topa kungah siempu pa adingin tung ding a, siempu pa in a khiel pa thoidam nadinga kibawl thoidamna tuutang pen zong tanbe lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel-te’ silpieh siengtho zosie lahah siempu pa kunga a peipi uh letsong zosie ama-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Silpieh siengtho zosie pen amau-a’ ahi hi; mi khatpo in siempu pa tunga a pieh poma ama-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-te hopi inlen amate kungah tam bangin gen in: Mi khatpo’ zi vahvai-in a pasal tungah a thuman sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />pasal khat in tua nu na luppi-in hizongle a pasal in tua khu a thei sih a, tua nu ama le ama a kibuasah hi napi koima in thei loin a khiel laitahin zong a kimat lo ziehin ama langkhatah teci pang ding mi a op lo vangin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a pasal in tua nu tungah ginmawna lungsim nei-in abuasa-in a upmaw a; ahi sihle abua lo kimlai ama tungah ginmawna lungsim nei-in mi tawh tua nu a ginmaw leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua pa in siempu pa kungah a zi peipi ding hi. Tuale ama in tua nu adingin a kisam mangbuham ephah khat’ sawm-ah-khat peipi ding hi. Ama in tua tungah sathau sung loin gimnamtui zong koi lo ding hi. Bang ding ahei cile tam khu ginmawna zieha an tawh biehna ahi a, khielna phawkia nadinga an tawh biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu pa in a nai-ah tua nu peipi-in Topa mai-ah koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siempu pa in leibeel khat tawh tui siengtho la ding a, biehbuh kem tunga leivui themkhat la-in tua tui sungah sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siempu pa in numei nu’ sam hlamkhe-in Topa mai-ah koi ding a, ama’ khutah ginmawna zieha an tawh biehna ahi an tawh phawkiana biehna tawisah ding hi. Siempu pa in ama’ khut sungah samsietna tuisie tawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu pa in tua nu kiciemsah ding a, “Nang in na pasal’ uhna nei-a na om sungin koima’ pasal in hing luppi loin, a sieng lo lama a kihei lo na hi leh, samsiet ang tun thei tami tuisie panin suohta in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hizongle na pasal’ uhna nei-a na om sungin vahvai-in nang le nang na kibuasah a, na pasal simlo pasal dang khatin ang luppi a ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />siempu pa in tua numei kiciemsahin ama kungah, “ Topa in na sulbu hing kiesahin na gilpi ang pawhsah ciengin, na mite lahah hamsie le kiciemna-a zah dingin Topa in hing bawl taheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tu-in tami tuisie in na gil sung zui hinlen, na gilpi pawhsahin na sulbu kiesah taheh!” ci ding hi. Tuale numei in, “Amen. Amen,” ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu pa in tua samsietna thu zosie laibu sungah gielin a unpi-in tuisie sungah sawp sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in samsietna a tun thei tua tuisie pen numei nu dawnsah dinga, ama sungah tua tui lutin aicim taangkha bang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siempu pa in numei nu’ khut sung panin ginmawna zieha an tawh biehna la ding a, ama in Topa mai-ah tua an tawh biehna pen vei-in maitam ah peipi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />siempu pa in phawna satanh dingin an tawh biehna lahah khutdim khat hamin maitam tungah hal ding a, tua ciengin numei nu tuisie dawnsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in numei nu tuisie a dawnsah zaw ciengin, numei nu ama le ama kibuasahin a pasal tunga a muonhuoi lo ahile, ama sungah samsietna a tun thei tua tuisie lutin aicim tangkha bang ding a, a gilpi pawhin a sulbu kie ding a, tuaci’n mite lahah tua numei samsietna-in kizang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin a numei ama le ama kibuasah lo a, a sieng ahi nah leh ama a khiel lo ahi a, tuaci’n ama nu suohta-in ta nei thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam pen a pasal’ uhna sunga a om zi khat vahvai-in a kibuasah ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ahi sihle a pasal in ama tungah ginmawna lungsim nei-in a zi mi tawh a upmaw ciengin tua bang kiginmawna thute-a zah ding thukham ahi hi; tua ciengin ama in Topa mai-ah tua numei koi ding a, tua ciengin siempu pa in numei nu tungah tam thukham zosie zang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasal pa pen khielna panin suohta ding a, ahi vangin numei in ama’ khielna puo ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in Israel-te kungah tam bangin gen in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasal ahi a, numei ahi zongin, amau le amau Topa tunga a kituomkoi nadingun a tuom vilvela kiciemna ahi Nazir kiciemna a bawl ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />lenggazu le khamtheizu panin amate a kituomkoi ding uhi; zu pana a kibawl zuthua le adang zuthuate dawn loin, lengga a hing ahi a, a gaw ahi zongin a dawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nazir mite banga zia a tan sung teng uh lenggui pana pieng bangma a ne sih ding vua, a tangte ahi sihle a hawte nangawn zong a ne sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nazir kiciemna hun sung teng zosie-un a lutung vuah mulmetna a tukha sih ding hi; Topa adinga amau le amau kiciemna hun a cin masangsie amate a siengtho ahi ding uhi; amate in a zangsam uh a sau-in khawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa dinga a kituomkoi hun sung zosie-un mi siluong nai-ah a pei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nu ahi sihle a pa, a sanggamnu ahi sihle a sanggampa nangawn a si zongin amau le amau a kibuasah sih ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Pasien tunga amau’ kisiensuona khu a lu tung vuah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nazir mite banga a om hun sung zosie uh Topa dingin a siengtho ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi khatpo a gei vuah thakhatin si-in a kisiensuona sam a buasah uleh a ni sagi ni, a kisiensuo ni-in a sam uh heu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni giet ni-in siempu pa kunga kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah vakhu ni ahi sihle palva no ni a tawi ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />siempu pa in khat pen mawna zieha biehna-in pie-in, adang khat pen meihal biehna-in nei ding a, amate dingin thoidamna a bawlpieh ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate pen misi luong zieha a khiel ahi uhi. Khum ni ma-in a lu a siensuo ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nazir mite banga a tuom om uh hun sung tengin Topa dingin amate a kituomkoi ding vua, khielna zieha biehna dingin kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat a peipi ding uhi. A kisiensuosa lutang abua zo tah ziehin masang lama hunte kisim nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam pen a kisiensuo hun uh a cin cienga a zui ding uh Nazir mite ngaina ahi hi: Kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah amate kipeipi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa tungah a letsongte uh pie-in meihal biehna dingin kum khat a pha paubang lo tuuno apa khat, mawna zieha biehna dingin kum khat a pha paubang lo tuuno anu khat, le thunuoma biehna dingin paubang lo tuutang khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />le tol saw lo anlum law khat, sathau tawh kipawi annel mohte, le tol saw lo sathau kinu mophengte, le an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate a peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa mai-ah siempu pa in tua teng peipi ding a, mawna zieha a biehnate ule a meihal biehnate uh pie-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuutang pen thunuom biehpiehna adingin Topa tungah tol saw lo anlum law tawh pieton ding hi; siempu pa in an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehna tawh zong pieh tha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin nazir mite in kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah a kisiensuosa ahi a sam uh a heukieu-in a kisiensuo a lutang panun a samte uh a la ding vua, thunuom biehpiehna nei-a a om mei sungah hal ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siempu pa in a kihuon minsa tuutang lieng le law sung pana tol saw lo moh khat, le tol saw lo mopheng khat la ding a, amate in a kisiensuosa a lutang vua samte a heukieu zaw ciengun nazir mite’ khutphang sungah tuate koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna dingin siempu pa in tuate a vei ding hi; tua teng pen a awmsa le a phei tawh siempu pa adingin a siengtho ama’ tanh ahi hi. Tua ciengin nazir mite in lenggazu dawn thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam pen kiciemna a nei nazir mite zui ding thukham ahi hi. Adang a pieh zaw zaza uh banah, Topa tunga a pieh ding uh amau’ biehna pen nazir kiciemna bang hi ding hi. Amau’ kiciemna bangin a bawl ding vua, siensuona thukham bang a zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate hopi inlen, tam bangin Israel-te thupha na pie ding uhi, ci-in gen in: Nangma in amate kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in note thupha hing pie hinlen; hing kem taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in na tung vuah a maitang hing tangsahin, hing lungsiet taheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in hing maingatin, note nopsahna hing pie taheh, na ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel-te tungah keima’ min a koi ding vua, keima in amate thupha ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in biehbuh dingsahin a vanzah zosie sathau nu-in siensuo a, tuale maitam le a vanzah zosie teng sathau nu-in a siensuo a man ni-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel makaite, amau’ pupa innkuon makaite, a kisim mite a uh minam makaite in biehna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in a tungkhu nei leeng guh le bawngtang sawm le ni, makai ni in leng khat ciet, makai khat in bawngtang khat ciet Topa mai-ah biehna-in a peipi uhi; amate in biehbuh mai-ah tuate a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh nasepna-a zah dingin amate tung panin tam teng sang inlen, a nasep ciet utawh kizui-in Levi-te pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in leengte le bawngtangte la-in Levi-te tungah tuate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau’ nasep tawh kizui-in Gershon-te kungah leeng ni le bawngtang li a pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama in siempu Aaron’ tapa Ithamar uhna nei-ah na a sem Merari-te tungah a nasep utawh kizui-in leeng li le bawngtang giet a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in Kohath-te tungah bangma pie lo hi. Azieh pen liengko-a a puoh ding uh siengtho nate kep ding amate tavuon kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maitam sathau a kinu hun ciengin makaite in zong maitam apna ding biehnate a pie uhi; makaite in a biehna uh maitam mai-ah a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin a gen hi: Maitam ap nadingin makai khat in ni khat ciet a biehna uh pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ni masa ni-a biehna piepa pen Judah minam, Amminadab’ tapa Nahshon ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ama’ silpieh pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dinga sathau tawh kihal annel tuituoh tua a kuong gel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />shekel sawm a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga ahi hi. Tam pen Amminadab’ tapa Nahshon’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni ni ni-in Issachar-te makai Zuar’ tapa Nethanel in biehna a pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a biehna dingin ama in mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun pakan khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuongdai khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau tawh kihal annel tuituoh tua kuong gel dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />shekel sawmsagi a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga a hi hi. Tam pen Zuar’ tapa Nethanel’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in Zebulun-te makai Helon’ tapa Eliab ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama biehna pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau kihal annel tuituoh tua kuong gel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />shekel sawmsagi a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga ahi hi. Tam pen Helon’ tapa Eliab’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A ni li ni-in Reuben-te makai Shedeur’ tapa Elizur ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama biehna pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau tawh a kihal annel tuituoh tua kuong tegel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />shekel sawmsagi a khai gimnamtui kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga ahi hi. Tam pen Shedeur’ tapa Elizur’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A ni nga ni-in Simeon-te makai Zurishaddai’ tapa Shelumiel ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama biehna pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau tawh kihal annel tuituoh kuong gel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />shekel sawm a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />le thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga ahi hi. Tam pen Zurishaddai’ tapa Shelumiel’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A ni guh ni-in Gad-te makai Deuel’ tapa Eliasaph ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama biehna pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau kihal annel tuituoh tua kuong gel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />shekel sawm a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />le thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga ahi hi. Tam pen Deuel’ tapa Eliasaph’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in Ephraim-te makai Ammihud’ tapa Elishama ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ama biehna pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau kihal annel tuituoh tua kuong gel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />shekel sawm a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />le thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga ahi hi. Tam pen Ammihud’ tapa Elishama’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />A ni giet ni-in Manasseh-te makai Pedahzur’ tapa Gamaliel ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ama biehna pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau kihal annel tuituoh tua kuong gel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />shekel sawmsagi a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />le thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga ahi hi. Tam pen Pedahzur’ tapa Gamaliel’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />A ni kuo ni-in Benjamin-te makai Gideoni’ tapa Abidan ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Ama biehna pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau kihal annel tuituoh tua kuong gel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />shekel sawm a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />le thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga ahi hi. Tam pen Gideoni’ tapa Abidan’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A ni sawm ni-in Dan-te makai Ammishaddai’ tapa Ahiezer ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Ama biehna pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau kihal annel tuituoh tua kuong gel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />shekel sawm a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />le thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga a hi hi. Tam pen Ammishaddai’ tapa Ahiezer’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />A ni sawm le khat ni-in Asher-te makai Okran’ tapa Pagiel ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Ama biehna pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau kihal annel tuituoh tua kuong gel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />shekel sawm a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />le thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga ahi hi. Tam pen Okran’ tapa Pagiel’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />A sawm le ni ni-in Naphtali-te makai Enan’ tapa Ahira ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Ama biehna pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel zakhat le sawmthum a khai ngun kuongdai khat, shekel sawmsagi a khai ngun kuong khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau kihal annel tuituoh tua kuong gel a dimvum tuoh tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />shekel sawm a khai gimnamtui a dim kham pakan khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" />mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" />le thunuom biehpiehna dingin bawngtang ni, tuutang nga, keel apa nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa nga hi hi. Tam pen Enan’ tapa Ahira’ silpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Maitam sathau a kinu ni-in tua maitam ap nadinga Israel lamkaite in a pieh uh biehna pen tam teng ahi hi: Ngun kuongdai sawm le ni, ngun kuong sawm le ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" />ngun kuongdai khat ciengin shekel zakhat le sawmthum khai-in ngun kuong khat ciengin shekel sawmsagi khai a, ngun kuong zosie pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in shekel tulni le zali khai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" />Gim namtui a dim kham pakan sawm le nite, mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in khat in shekel sawm khai a, kham pakan zosie shekel zakhat le sawmni khai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" />meihal biehna dingin ganhon zosie ahi bawngtang sawm le ni, kum khat a pha tuuno apa sawm le ni, an tawh biehnate tawh; tuale mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa sawm le ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="88" style="v" />thunuom biehpiehna dingin ganhon zosie ahi bawngtang sawmni le li, tuutang sawmguh, keel apa sawmguh, kum khat a pha tuuno apa sawmguh ahi hi. Tam teng pen maitam sathau a kinu zaw cienga apna biehnate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Kikhopna buh sungah Topa tawh kiho dingin Moses a lut ciengin cherub ni gel kikal thuciemna singkuong tunga om hepina topha tung panin ama a hopi awging a za hi; tua bang awging in Moses a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: Meivahte na koi ciengin meivah sagite in meivah tunna mai teng a tan dingin koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua bangin Aaron in a bawl hi. Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin ama in meivah tunna mai teng a tan dingin meivahte koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam meivah tunna kibawl dan pen kham tawh kiseh ahi hi. A tunna panin a papete dongin a kiseh ahi hi; Topa in Moses a lahsa lim dan dung zui-in ama in meivah tunna a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel-te lah panin Levi-te ladawh inlen siensuo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate siensuo nadingin a tung vuah tam bangin bawl in: Siensuona tui a tung vuah the inlen, a pumtung zosie uh mulmetna tawh metsah inlen, a puonte uh sawpin amate ma na kisiensuosah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin bawngtangno khat le sathau kihal annel tuituoh tawh kibawl an tawh biehna na la sah ding a, nang in mawna zieha biehna dingin adang bawngtangno khat na la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh mai-ah Levi-te na zawpi ding a, Israel mihon buppi na khawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa mai-ah Levi-te na zawpi ciengin Israel-te in Levi-te tungah a khut uh a ngam ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amate in Topa’ na a sep thei nadingun Aaron in Israel-te lah panin Levi-te, Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna-in a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Levi-te in bawngtangte’ lu tungah khut a ngam ding vua, Levi-te ading thoidamna bawl nadingin Topa tungah mawna zieha biehna-in khat, meihal biehna-in a khat, na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Aaron le a tapate mai-ah Levi-te na dingsah ding a, Topa tunga a kivei biehna-in amate na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua bangin Israel-te lah panin Levi-te na tuomkoi ding a, Levi-te keima-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate siensuo-in a kivei biehna-in na pieh zaw ciengin kikhopna puonbuh-ah na sem dingin Levi-te lut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen Israel-te lah panin kei tungah amate ang kipie sieng ahi ta uhi. Israel-te’ tacil zosie, naubu a hong masa zosie tangin keima adingin amate ka la zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen Israel-te lah panin tacil zosie mihing hile ganhing hile a nipi-in keima-a’ ahi hi. Egypt gam sungah tacil zosie ka thagam ni-in keima dingin amate ka siensuo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ahi vangin Israel-te lah panin tacil zosie tangin Levi- te ka la zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tham loin kikhopna puonbuh-ah Israel-te dinga na sem ding le mun siengtho tawh kinai-a a pei Israel-te lahah gimna a tun lo nadinga thoidamna a bawlpieh dingin Israel-te lah panin Aaron le a tapate tungah letsongin Levi-te ka pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses le Aaron le Israel mihonpi zosie in Levi-te tungah tua bangin a bawl uhi; amate tawh kisai-in Topa in Moses kunga a thupiehsa bang lien ma-in Israel-te in Levi-te tungah a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mawna panin Levi-te kisiensuo-in a puonte a sawpsieng uhi; tua ciengin Aaron in a kivei biehna-in Topa mai-ah amate pie a, a sientho nadingun Aaron in amate dingin thoidamna a bawlpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Aaron le a tapate opna kikhopna puonbuh sunga na a sem dingin Levi-te a sungtum uhi. Levi-te tawh kisai-in Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin amate tungah a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam pen Levi-te tunga zah ding ahi hi: Kikhopna puonbuh nasepna sunga a sem dingin kum sawmni le nga pan a tungsie a phate kipan ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuale kum sawmnga a phah vua kipanin nasepna pan khawlin bangma a sem nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh sunga a sanggamte a hu thei bep ding vua, hizongle amate in na a sem nawn sih ding uhi. Tam bangin Levi-te nasep ding na sepieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate Egypt panin a peizaw uh a kum ni cin kum, a hla khatna sungin Sinai senel gamah Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kise hunin Israel-te in peisan pawi bawlsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kise hun, tami hla ni sawm le li khuomut ciengin a thukham zosiete le a ngainate tawh kizui-in na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in Israel-te kungah peisan pawi a bawl nadingun a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hla masa, a ni sawm le li khuomut ciengin Sinai senel gamah amate in peisan pawi a bawl uhi. Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bang lienin Israel-te gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in misi luong thamkhah zieha abua mi pawlkhat om a, tuaci’n khum ni-in amate in peisan pawi a bawl sih uhi. Khum ni-in Moses le Aaron mai-ah amate a pei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama kungah, “Misi luong thamkhahna ziehin ka sientho sih vangun a kise hunin Israel-te lahah bang dingin Topa’ biehna ei kipiesah lo ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses in amate kungah, “Note’ thu tawh kisai-in Topa’ thupieh ka zah masangsie na ngah tadi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel-te hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: Note lahah mi khatpo in ahi a, na suon na hlahte uh khatpo in ahi zongin misi luong a khoikhah ziehin abua ahi a, ahi sihle a khuolzin laitah ahile Topa tungah amate in peisan pawi a bawl thei lai veve ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a hla nina a ni sawm le li ni khuomut ciengin pawi bawlin lopa khaate tawh tol saw lo anlum me ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zingmawng dongin bangma hen nei loin a gute zong a tawngsah sih ding uhi; amate in peisan pawi ngaina zosie tawh kizui-in a bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hizongle khuolzin lo napi-in a sieng mi khatpo in peisan pawi a bawl sih leh a kise huna Topa’ biehna pie lo ahi ziehin a mite kung panin kihemkhie ding hi; tua bang mipa in a mawna paat a thuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note lahah a teng pemta khatpo in Topa tungah peisan pawi a bawl nop leh peisan pawi thukhamte le a ngaina kipte bangin bawl ding hi; note in pemtate le tuolsung mite dingin ngaina a kibang na nei ton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biehbuh a din ni-in meii in biehbuh le thuciemna biehbuh a tuomcip hi; tuale nitah panin zingmawng cieng dongin biehbuh tung son-ah meikuong bangin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua bangin a om den hi: Sunin meii in tuomin zanin meikuong tawh kibang khat in a tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Puonbuh tung pan tua meii a kilahto popo ciengin Israel-te a dingkhie uhi; tuale meii khawlna munah Israel-te in giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa’ thupiehna tawh Israel-te a dingkhie vua, Topa’ thupiehna tawh giephuol a sat uhi. Biehbuh tungah meii a khawl laisie giephuol-ah amate a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biehbuh tungah ni tampi sung meii a om cieng nangawnin Israel-te in Topa’ sawlna mangin a dingkhie sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni tawmno khat sung biehbuh tungah meii om thei zel a, Topa’ thupieh tawh kizui-in giephuol-ah a om uhi. Tua ciengin Topa’ thupieh tawh kizui-in amate a dingkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khat veivei nitah pan zingmawng dongin tua meii a om hi; tuale zingmawngin meii a kilahto ciengin amate a dingkhie vua, ahi sihle sun khat le zan khat a omlai le zong, meii a kilahto ciengin amate a dingkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni ni ahi a, hla khat ahi a, a hun sauzaw ahi zongin, biehbuh tung sonah meii a khawl laisie giephuol-ah Israel-te om denin a dingkhie sih uhi; hizongle tua meii a kilahto ciengin a dingkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa’ thupiehna tawh amate in giephuol a sat vua, Topa’ thupiehna tawh a dingkhie uhi. Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin amate in Topa’ sawlna a mang uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngun pengkul ni bawl in; tuate na bawl ciengin na kheng ding a, mipite khop nading le giephuol phel nadingin tuate na zang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ni-in a kimuton ciengin kikhopna puonbuh lutna nangma mai-ah mihon buppi kikhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle khat beh a kimut leh nangma mai-ah Israel minamte’ lutang ahi makaite kikhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Patau pengkul na mut ciengin nisuona lam panga giephuol-ate dingkhie-in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />patau pengkul a ni veina na mut ciengin leitaw lama giephuol-ate dingkhie ding uhi. Amate a dinkhiet ding poma ciengun patau pengkul kimut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin mihonpi a kikaikhop ding ciengin pengkul na mut ding a, hizongle patau pengkul na mut sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aaron’ tapa siempute in pengkul a mut ding uhi; tami khu note dinga na khang tawntung vua a kipden ngaina khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na gam sung vuah note ang gawt na galte do dinga na kuon ciengun, Topa na Pasien uh mai-ah ang kiphaw nadingin pengkulte tawh patauna aw na gingsah ding vua, tuaci’n na galte khut uh sung panin ang kihundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lungdam hun uh, a kise na pawi hunte uh, na hla kipat hunte uh, na meihal biehnate ule na thunuom biehpiehnate vuah zong pengkulte na tum ding uhi; tuate pen na Pasien uh mai-ah note phawna-in kimang ding hi: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kum nina, a hla nina, a ni sawmnina ni-in thuciemna biehbuh tung son panin meii kilato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Sinai senel gam panin phuol khat pan phuol khatah Israel-te a dingkhie vua, tuaci’n Paran gamlahah meii a khawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses tungtawnin Topa’ thupiehna tawh amate a khat veina khuolzin a kipan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah giephuol dielkhai neite a pawlpawlin a dingkhie masa vua, Amminadab’ tapa Nahshon in mihon buppi a makai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zuar’ tapa Nethanel in Issachar minam honpite makai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Helon’ tapa Eliab in Zebulun minam honpite makai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Biehbuh a kiphel ciengin biehbuh a puo Gershon-te le Merari-te a dingkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zomah Reuben-te’ giephuol dielkhai neite a pawlpawlin a dingkhie uhi; tuale Shedeur’ tapa Elizur in tua mihon buppi a makai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zurishaddai’ tapa Shelumiel in Simeon minam honpite a makai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Deuel’ tapa Eliasaph in Gad minam honpite a makai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin a siengtho nate a puo Kohath-te a dingkhie uhi; amate tun masangin biehbuh na kiphut zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A zomah Ephraim-te’ giephuol dielkhai neite a pawlpawlin a dingkhie vua, Ammihud’ tapa Elishama in tua mihon buppi a makai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pedahzur’ tapa Gamaliel in Manasseh minam honpite a makai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gideoni’ tapa Abidan in Benjamin minam honpite a makai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin giephuol zosie’ nuadala a pang Dan mite’ giephuol dielkhai neite a pawlpawlin a dingkhie vua, Ammishaddai’ tapa Ahiezer in tua minam honpite a makai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ochran’ tapa Pagiel in Asher minam honpite a makai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Enan’ tapa Ahira in Naphtali minam honpite a makai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam pen Israel-te a dinkhiet cieng vua a pawlpawla a pei dan uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in a sungpa Midian mi Reuel’ tapa Hobab kungah, “ Topa in, ‘Na tung vuah kang pie ding hi,’ a cina mun zuona pei ding ka hi uhi. Hing pei inlen ko tawh zawhton vai, nang kang limbawl ding uhi; azieh pen Topa in Israel-te tungah sil hoi pieh ding ei kamciem zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “Kang pei sih ding hi. Ka leitang le ka tanaute kungah ka pei zaw ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in, “Kote ei taisan sin. Azieh pen gamlahah giephuol sat nading mun na thei ziehin ka lampu ding uh na hibo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua banah kote ei zui lacin, Topa in ka tung vua a sep sil hoi poma kote tawh kibangin kang bawlpieh ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa’ muol panin amate dingkhie-in ni thum peina khuol a zin vua, khawl mun sui dingin a masang vuah Topa’ thuciemna singkuong, nithum lam na peikhol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Giephuol pan amate a dinkhiet ciengun sunin a tung vuah Topa’ meii a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Singkuong a dinkhiet popo ciengin Moses in, “ Topa aw, tho-in, na galte kithezah hinlen, nang ang mudate na mai panin taimang ta uheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A khawl popo ciengin ama in, “ Topa aw, Israel a tul a tul sawmte kungah hing kinuale in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tuosietnate ziehun Topa’ zahin mite a phun ciengin Topa in tua thu za-in lungthah mama hi. Tua ciengin amate langkhatah Topa’ mei kuongin giephuol ninglam kimkhat a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses tungah mite a kiko vua, Topa kungah Moses in thungen a, tua mei a mit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa’ mei in amate a kahtum ziehin khum mun pen Taberah kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amahaw lahah om mi nautangte in antui a dugaw mama uhi; tuale Israel-te zong a kapkia vua, “I neh ding sa nei beh lei izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt gamah man pieh lo-a i neh uh ngate, tangmaite, dawnpawlte, kaisuon pumte, kaisuon sante, le kaisuon kangte i phawh uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ahi vangin tu-in i tha i zung uh lah a bei sieng ta a, i et ding uh tam manna simlo bangma dang om poma lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manna pen nanan tang tawh kibang a, a mel bedolak singnai tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mite pei kawikawi-in a khawm vua, an gawina tawh gawi-in ahi sihle sum sungah a suguoi vua, beel sungh huonin mohin a bawl uhi; a tui dan pen sathau tawh kikangzol sipsep moh tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zanin giephuol tungah vua a kieh ciengin manna tawh kieton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A puonbuh lutna zosie vuah a innkuonkuonin mite’ kaana Moses in a za hi. Tua ciengin Topa lungthah mama ahi ziehin Moses lungkim lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in Topa kungah, “Bang dingin na nasempa ei ci bawlsiet na hei? Bang dingin na maipha ei musah loin tam mite zosie’ vangih kei tunga nang ngah ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam mite zosie ka gil sunga ka pai amah? A pu a pate tungah pieh dinga ka ciemsa leitangah, ‘Nau cingnu in nawitep lai nausen a puoh bangin amate na kang sungah puo inlen peipi in,’ ci-in nang in kei kunga nei ci thei nadingin amate kei sunga pieng ahi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam mite zosie ka pieh ding hei sungah sa nga mawh ding ka hei? Bangzieh ahei cile amate kap kawmin ka kungah, ‘Ka neh ding uh sa ei pie in!’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam mi zosie kei guohin ka ci nading ka thei sih hi. Azieh pen kei adingin amate puoh gih luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam banga kei ei bawl ding na hi leh thakhatin ei that zaw vet in. Na muna-ah maipha ka nga leh ka gentheina ei musah sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in Moses kungah, “Nang in mite’ upa le a tung vuah ulien sem hi, ci-a na thei Israel upa mi sawmsagi kei adingin ei kholpieh in; kikhopna buhah amate zawpi inlen tua munah amate nang tawh mun hing lasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima hing kumsuhin khum munah nang tawh i kiho ding hi; na sunga om ka hla themkhat ladawhin amau’ sungah ka guong ding hi; nang guohin a unpi-in na puoh lo nadingin amate in mite’ vangih ang puohpi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mite kungah, ‘Zing cieng adingin no le no kisiensuo un, sa na ne ding uh; bang ding ahei cile Topa’ zahin na kap vua, ‘I neh ding uh sa nei lei izaw! Eite adingin Egypt gam a nuomzaw tahtah hi,’ na ci uhi. Tua ahi ziehin Topa in sa ang pie ding a, na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni khat sung beh, ahi sihle ni ni sung beh, ahi sihle ni nga sung beh, ahi sihle ni sawm sung beh, ahi sihle ni sawmni sung beh ne khop loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />na nahkua hawm vua a let masangsie le na luohsuo dong ciengun hla khat sung tungtawn sa na ne ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile note in na lah vua om Topa nuolin ama’ mai-ah na kap vua, “Bang dinga Egypt i nuasie uh ahei?” na ci uhi,’ ci-in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in, “Keima tawh a kisimton lei galkap tul zaguh pha hi; nang in, ‘Hla khat tungtawn a neh dingun amate sa pie vang!” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate dingin tuuhonte le bawnghonte kigo leh a kicingzo ding amah? Amate dingin tuipi sunga ngate kiman leh a kicingzo ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “ Topa’ sil bawltheina a kiciengtan na sa amah? Ka thugente nang adingin a mana ang tun leh ang tun lo tu-in na mu ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses pei-in mite kungah Topa’ thugen teng a gen a, ama in mite’ upa sawmsagi kaikhawmin puonbuh kimvelah a omsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin meii sungah Topa kumsuhin ama hopi a, ama’ sunga hla themkhat ladawhin upa sawmsagite sungah a guong hi; tuale amate tungah tua hla a tuh ciengin kamsangte bangin thu a gen uhi. Hizongle tua bangin amate a gamtakia nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Giephuol-ah mi ni a om vua, khat Eldad kici-in, a khat Medad kici a, ama gel sungah tua hla a lut hi. Misimna-ah ama gel a kihal vua, hinanle puonbuh-ah pei loin giephuol-ah thuphuon a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tangval khat tai-in Moses kungah, “Eldad le Medad in giephuol sungah thuphuon gen uhi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuale ama’ teel mite lahah Moses’ nasem Nun’ tapa Joshua in, “Ka pu Moses, ama gel khawlsah in!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in ama kungah, “Kei adinga a thangsie na hi amah? Topa’ mite zosie kamsang hi sieng hinlen, Topa in a sung vuah a hla hing guong leh ka cizaw a!” a ci hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuale giephuol-ah Moses le Israel upate a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa kung pan hui langin tua hui in tuipi panin vamimte puoh a, giephuol kung tam lampang ni khat peina cieng, khum lampang ni khat peina cieng ma, giephuol gei-ah kiesah a, lei maitang tungah pi thum bang a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaci’n sun tungtawn, zan tungtawn le a zing cieng tungtawnin mite in vamimte a khawm uhi; a tawm khop pen in homer sawm a khawm vua, amate dingin giephuol kimvelah tuate a pho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin vamim’ sa a kikhawn masang, a hakawm vuah sa baang laipi ma-in mite tungah Topa’ lungthahna kikuontaw a, gimna lienpi khat tawh Topa in mite a vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum mun pen Kibroth-hattaavah kici hi. Azieh pen khum munah amate in sa dugaw mite a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kibroth-hattaavah panin Hazeroth dongin mite a zin uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hazeroth-ah amate a ten laita hun Moses in Cush numei khat kinunpi ahi ziehin a kinunpi Cush numei tungtangah Miriam le Aaron in ama gensie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuale ama gel in, “ Moses tungtawn beha Topa in thu gen ahi amah? Eite tung zong tawnin thu gen hi lo amah?” a ci uhi. Topa in tua thu a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in Moses kici pa pen leitunga om mi zosie sangin mi nunnem zaw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in thakhatthu-in Moses, Aaron le Miriam kungah, “Kikhopna puonbuhah no teng thum hing pei un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n a thumun a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin meii lahah Topa kumsuhin kikhopna puonbuh lutna ah dingin Aaron le Miriam hlan hi; tuale ama gel zong mai lamah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in ama gel kungah, “Ka thugente ngai un: Na lah vuah kamsangte a op ciengin, keima Topa in mangmunate tawh a tung vuah keima le keima ka kitheisah a; mang sungah zong amate ka hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nasem Moses tawh tua bang ahi sih a; ka inn sung thu vannuoi ama ki-ap sieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in ama tawh kimaituo-in thu ka gen a, a kitel lo kamham tawh hi loin; a kiteltahin ka hopi a, tuaci’n ama in Topa’ mel a mu hi. Tua ahile bang dinga ka nasempa Moses gensiet ding zau lo na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama gel tungah Topa’ lungthahna kuongin a pei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puonbuh tung panin meii a pei ciengin Miriam phah a, vua bangin a ngo hi. Miriam lamah Aaron a kihei leh tua numei a phah lam a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Aaron in Moses kungah, “Ka pu aw, ka mot gamtat zieh vua ka bawl uh mawna ziehin kote dan ei pie sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama a nu gilsung pan a suo cienga atel avo alang beisa-a suoh nausen hing bangsah sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale Moses in Topa kungah, “Ama damsah in, Pasien aw, hing thum ing,” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in Moses kungah, “A pa in tua numei’ maitang cilphit leh tua numei ni sagi sung zumsi lo ding amah? Ni sagi sung giephuol pulamah ama puse inlen, tua zaw ciengin ama kipeipi kia thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n giephuol pulamah ni sagi sung Miriam kipuse hi; tuale Miriam a kipeipi masangsie khuolzin zom dingin mite a dingkhie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Hazeroth panin mite a dingkhie vua, Paran gamlahah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel-te tunga ka pieh Canaan gam vaan dingin mite sawl inlen, amate lahah makai ahi, minam khat sung panin mi khat ciet sawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa’ thupieh tawh kizui-in Moses in Paran gamlah panin Israel-te lahah makai zosie a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau’ min tam teng ahi hi: Reuben minam panin Zaccur’ tapa Shammua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simeon minam panin Hori’ tapa Shaphat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah minam panin Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Issachar minam panin Joseph’ tapa Igal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim minam panin Nun’ tapa Hoshea;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Benjamin minam panin Raphu’ tapa Palti;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zebulun minam panin Sodi’ tapa Gaddiel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joseph minam (Manasseh minam) panin Susi’ tapa Gaddi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan minam panin Gemalli’ tapa Ammiel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asher minam panin Michael’ tapa Sethur;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Naphtali minam panin Vophsi’ tapa Nahbi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gad minam panin Machi’ tapa Geuel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam teng pen gam ensim dinga Moses in a sawl mite’ min ahi hi. Nun’ tapa Hoshea pen Moses in Joshua ci-in a min khelpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Moses in Canaan gam vaan dingin amate sawlin a kung vuah, “Negeb gam sung khum munah peito-in, muoltung gamah kato unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a gam bang tawh kibang a, a sunga teng mite thahat maw, ahi sihle zawngkhal, citawm maw, ahi sihle citam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a tenna gam uh hoi maw, ahi sihle hoi lo, a tenna a khuopite uh giephuol maimai maw, ahi sihle kulpi tawh ki-im maw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a leitang lei hoi maw, ahi sihle hoi lo, tua sungah sing po maw, ahi sihle po lo, hing en ta un. Hangsan unlen tua gama a ga pawlkhat zong hing peipi ta un,” a ci hi. Khum hun pen lengga palte min hun tah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate a peito vua, Zin gamlah panin Lebo-hamath khuo gei Rehob mun dongin gam a vaan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Negeb lamah amate peito-in Hebron a tung uhi; tua munah Anak’ suon le hlahte ahi Ahiman-te, Shesai-te, le Talmai-te a na om uhi. (Hebron khuo pen Egypt gama Zoan khuo sangin kum sagi-in kisat masazaw hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eshcol Kuom a tung vua, khum munah lengga bawh khat beh a ba tawh sattanin mihing ni in ciengzawl khatin a zawngton uhi. Amate in mang kawlsingte le thei themkhat zong a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel-te in khum tah panin a bawh khat a sattan ziehun khum mun pen Eshcol Kuom kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ni sawmli a cin zaw ciengin gam vaanna panin amate kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Paran gamlah Kadesh mun Moses le Aaron le Israel mihonte kungah amate a tung uhi; tuale mihon zosie’ tung le amate tungah thu a puoh vua, tua leitanga gate amate a lah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in Moses kungah, “Nei sawlna leitang ka va pha ta uhi; tua gamah bawngnawi le khuoizu luong a, tam khu a gate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hizongle tua gama tengte a thahat vua, a khuopite uh kul tawh a ki-im a, zong gol thei mama hi; tam teng banah khum munah Anak’ suonlehlahte ka mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Negeb gamah Amalek-te a teng uhi; muoltung gamah Hit-te, Jebus-te, le Amor-te teng uhi; tuipi gei le Jordan gun dungah Canaan-te a teng uhi,” ci-in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin Caleb in Moses mai-ah a mite sipsahin amate kungah, “Thakhatin pei-in a gam uh va la ta vai, azieh pen khum gam i zo thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama tawh a peito mite in, “Tua mite do dinga kuonto zo ding i hi malmal sih uhi. Bang zieh ahei cile amate pen eite sanga a hatzaw mawngmawng uh ahi bo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in a sielamin Israel-te tungah a gam vanna uh thu a puoh vua, “A van dinga ka va peina uh leitang in a sunga tengte a valtum hi. Khum gam sunga mi ka mu vannuoi uh gol thei mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khum munah Nephilim-te (Nephilim panin Anak-te pieng hi) ka mu uhi; amate lahah ko le ko ka ki-et ciengun khuombai cie behin ka kimu vua, amau’ ei muna-ah zong tua bangma ka hi lel uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin mihon zosie khum zanin kiko-in a kap vapo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale Israel-te zosie in Moses le Aaron a phunsan vua, mihon buppi in a kung vuah, “Egypt gamah kisi dawh ta lei izaw! Ahi sihle tami gamlahah kisi dawh ta lei izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang dinga Topa in tami gamah namsau-a si dinga ei na peipi a ta diei? Ka zite ule ka nausente uh lah galte’ hingmat ding bep ahi ta uhi; Egypt gamah kilekia uleng hoizaw lo ding amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate khatlekhat a kiho vua, “Makai khat tel vai-in, Egypt-ah kilekia vai,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kikhawm Israel mihonpi zosie’ mai-ah Moses le Aaron a khupboh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale gam vante lahah a kihal Nun’ tapa Joshua le Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb in a puonte a botkeh vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mihon buppi kungah, “A van dinga ka va peina uh gam pen a hoi mama gam khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eite tunga Topa a lungkim leh bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna khum gamah ei peipi-in khum gam ei pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa langpan sih popo unlen; tua gama mite giing sih un, azieh pen eite dingin amate pen i neh ding uh an ahi bo uhi; a kung panun a kidalna uh kiladawh ahi ta a, Topa in eite ei ompi hi; amate giing sih un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin mihon buppi in suong tawh selia dingin amate a galgih uhi. Tua ciengin kikhopna puonbuh sunga om Israel mi zosie tungah Topa’ minthanna a kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Tam mite in bang tanvei kei ei simmaw ding uh ahei? Amate lahah ka bawlsa limte om napi bang tanvei kei ei um lolai ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pul natna tawh amate vatmai-in tapa’ za panin ka phiet ding a, amate sanga a lienzaw le a thahatzaw minamin nangma kang bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in Topa kungah, “Tua hi mawh leh Egypt-te in tua thu a na za ding uhi. Azieh pen nangma in amate lah panin na thahatna tawh tam mite na peipi ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />amate in tam gam mite kungah tua thu a na gen ding uhi. Topa aw, amate in tam mite laizangah na om lam za zo uhi; bang ding ahei cile Topa aw, kimaituo-in nang ang kimu a, amate tungah nangma’ meii zamin sun ciengin meiilumin, zan ciengin meikuongin a masang vuah na pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in tam mite a unpi-un tha khatin that sieng mawh lacin nangma’ thu a zasa minamte in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Amahaw tunga pieh dinga a kamciemsa leitangah Topa in tam mite tut zo lo ahi ziehin ama in gamlahah amate thatgam ta hi,’ ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in nangma in hopi-in na kam ciem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘ Topa lungthah bai loin, a itna kip kicing a, mawna le khielnate maisahin, hinanle a mawte siengsah loin, pate’ mawna tate tungah, khang thum khang lina dongin thuh hi,’ na ci ciengin Topa a vang lien taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Egypt gama a peikhiet vua kipan tu dong nangawnin tam mite’ khielna na maisah ma bangin a lien mama na itna kip dung zui-in tam mite’ khielna maisah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in, “Na nget bangin ka maisah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />hinanle - kei ka nungta a, Topa’ minthanna khu leitung kidim ding ahi ma bangin-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Egypt le gamlahah ka bawlsa ka vanglietna le ka limte mu zo napi-in keima sawmvei ei ze-etin ka aw a ngai lo mite in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a pate uh tunga pieh dinga ka ciem leitang koima in a mu sih ding uhi; keima ei simmaw mi koima khat beh in tua leitang a mu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka nasempa Caleb in lungsim tuom a puo a, lungsim tahpi tawh keima ei zui ahi ziehin a va peina gamah ama ka peipi ding a, a suonlehlahte in tua gam a luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in khum kuom tengah Amalek-te le Canaan-te a ten ziehun zing ciengin kihei-in San Tuipi zotna lampi zui-in gamlahah pei un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron hopi-in ama gel kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tam a gilo mihonte in bang tanvei kei ei mawsah ding uh ahei? Keima in Israel-te’ ei mawsahna ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate kungah gen in: Topa in, “Kei a nungta ka hi ma bangin tua na thugente ma uh na tung vuah kang bawl ding hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tami gamah na luonghawmte uh lum ding hi; na mi phaza zosie uh, mi kisimna sunga kihal teng, pasal kum sawmni pana tungsie, kei ei phunsante,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb le Nun’ tapa Joshua simlo, na tenna ding vua ka kiciemna leitangah khat beh na tung sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin galte mat ding na ci uh na tasente uh ka peipi ding a, amate in na thusim lo uh leitang a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin note na hi uleh tami gamlahah na luong uh a lum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anukhia pen gamlahah na luonghawm uh a kisiel masang, gamlahah na tate uh kum sawmli sung tuucing ahi ding vua, na up lona ziehun amate in gimna a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Note in na gam van sung ni phaza tawh kizui-in ni sawmli, ni khat ciengin kum khat, na khielna uh kum sawmli sung na thuoh ding vua, ka lungkimlona na thei ding uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Keima Topa in ka gen zo hi; kei ei do dinga kikhawm tam a gilo mihon zosie tungah tam bangin ka bawl valon ding hi; tam gamlah ah mangthai-in khum munah a si gam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Gam van dinga Moses in a sawl mite kilekia-in a gam thu a sielamin a tut ziehun mihonte Topa a phunsansah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />khum gam tungtang a sielama a gen tua mite, Topa mai-ah gimna tawh a sigam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vangin gam van dinga a kuonte lahah Nun’ tapa Joshua le Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb tegel beh hing lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Moses in Israel-te zosie tungah tami thute a gen ciengin nahpitahin mite a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Zingmawng phalvah tahin tho-in muoltung gam muolsang dawnah a peito vua, “Eite tanah i om uhi. Topa’ ciemsa munah i peito ding uhi. Bang ding ahei cile eite i maw zo ta hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in, “Bang dinga Topa’ thupiehna na palsat uh ahei? Tua khu a tangtung sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Note lahah Topa om lo ahi ziehin peito sih unlen, na galte in kisatlia sah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Amalek-te le Canaan-te in khum munah hing do ding ahi ziehin namsau tawh na sigam ding uhi; bang ding ahei cile Topa nua na zuina panun kilekia na hi ziehun Topa in note ang ompi ta sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa’ thuciemna singkuong le Moses in giephuol nuasie lo napi amate in muoltung gam muolsang dawn kato ding a ngaisun veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ciengin muoltung gama a teng Amalek-te le Canaan-te kumsuhin amate a zo gawp vua, Hormah cieng dong a nuadel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-te hopi inlen a kung vuah tam bangin gen in: Kang pieh leitanga teng dingin na tun ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa tungah mei tawh kihal biehna bawl nadingin bawnghon pan ahi a, tuuhon pan ahi zongin na pieh ciengun, Topa dinga a namtui dingin meihal biehna hile, biehpiehna hile, nop thu-a biehna hile, kiciemna khat tangtun nading biehna hile, a kise hunte sunga biehna hile na pieh uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua biehna a pie ding popo in Topa tungah annel ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-sekhat, sathau hin khat’ seli- suo-sekhat tawh a kibawl an tawh biehna pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua banah dawn thei biehna dingin lenggazu hin khat’ seli-suo-sekhat, meihal biehna ahi sihle biehpieh nadingin tuuno khat ciet tawh na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuutang adingin annel ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-seni, sathau hin khat’ sethum-suo -sekhat tawh kibawl an tawh biehna na pie ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa tungah a gimnamtui dawn thei biehna dingin lenggazu hin khat’ sethum-suo-sekhat na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Meihal biehna ding ahi a, thuciemna khat tunsah nading ahi a, thunuom biehna ding ahi zongin, Topa tungah bawngtang khat na pieh ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua bawngtang tawh annel ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-sethum sathau hin lang tawh kihal an tawh biehna na pie ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa tungah a gimnamtui, mei tawh kihal biehna-in dawn thei biehna lenggazu hin khat’ alang na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawngtang khat ciet ahi a, tuutang khat ciet ahi zongin, tuuno apa khat ciet ahi a, keelno apa khat ciet tawh ahi zongin piehton dingin tua bangin kibawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na pieh uh ganhing phaza tawh kizui-in mi zosie in tua bangin a bawl ciet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa tungah a gimnamtui, mei tawh kihal biehna a pieh ciengun, Israel tuolsung mi zosie in tami nate tam bangin a bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note tawh a tengton pemta khat hile, note lahah a khang tawntunga ang teng khat hile, ama in Topa tungah a gimnamtui, mei tawh kihal biehna a pieh nop leh note bawl bang ma-in a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note le note lahah a teng pemta mihonte in ngaina khat beh nei ding a, tua khu na khang tawntung vua na zui ding uh ngaina kip khat hi den ding hi; Topa mai-ah note le pemtate na kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note le na ompi uh pemtate adingin a kibang thukham khat le ngaina kip khat om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel-te hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: Kang peipi nading gam na tun vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua gama pieng an na neh ciengun, Topa tungah silpieh na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na anneh masah pente uh panin silpieh dingin moh lum khat na pie ding uhi; tua khu an cilna pana silpieh na pieh bangun na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na khang tawntung vua na anlah masa pen uh Topa tungah silpiehin na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in Moses kungah a na gensa tam thupiehte zosie-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in a thupiehte a pieh ni le a pieh zaw-a kipanin na khang tawntung vua Topa in Moses tungtawna ang thupieh zosie na zui sih uleh-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />mihonpi’ thei loin sawm khol lopi-a kibawl ahile mihon zosie in Topa tungah a gimnamtui dingin ngaina kip a om bangin meihal biehna dingin bawngtangno khat an tawh biehna, dawn thei biehna tawh na pieton ding vua, mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siempu pa in Israel mihon zosie adingin thoidamna bawlpieh ding a, tuaci’n amate kimaisah ding hi; tua khu sawm khol lopi-a khielna hi a, amate in a khielna zieh vua Topa tungah mei tawh kihal a biehna ule a mawna zieh vua a biehna uh, Topa mai-ah a peipi zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel mihon buppi le amate lahah teng pemtate zong kimaisah ding hi. Azieh pen tua khielna-ah mi buppi kihal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sawm khol lopi-in mi khat a maw leh mawna zieha biehna dingin kum khat a pha keelnu khat pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sawm khol lopi-in mi khat in khielna a bawl ciengin tua pa adingin siempu pa in Topa mai-ah thoidamna bawlpieh ding a, thoidamna a kibawlpieh zaw ciengin a mawna kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel-te lahah a teng tuolsung mipa le pemta pa adingin- a gamta khiel a koima po in ngaina kibang khat na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuolsung mi ahi a, pemta ahi zongin hangsan taha khielna a bawl teitei mi poma Topa simmaw ahi a, a mite lah panin kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa’ thu simmaw-in a thupieh a palsat ziehin tua bang mipa pen kihemkhie kilkel ding a, ama’ khielna ama in thuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gamlahah Israel-te a op lai-un, Sabbath ni-in singtom mi khat a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A singtom laitah a mu teng in Aaron le Moses, le mihon bup mai-ah ama a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama banglaw ding ci kicien lo ahi ziehin ama a khumcip tadi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Tua mipa thalup ding ahi hi; giephuol pulamah mipi zosie in suong tawh seplia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin mipi zosie in giephuol pulamah peipi-in suong tawh ama a seplia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Israel-te hopi inlen a khang tungtawnun a puon mong vuah a tep bawlin, tua a puon mongtep ciet tungah khaudum khat khisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua puon mongtep na mu ciengun na lungsim deigawna ule na mittang’ deinate uh zuikha loin, Topa’ thupieh zosie phawhin na zui nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka thupieh zosie phawhin na zui ding vua, na Pasien uh tungah na siengtho ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Na Pasien uh ka hi thei nadinga Egypt gam pana ang peipi Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Levi’ tapa Kohath, Kohath’ tapa Izhar, Izhar’ tapa Korah in Reuben suonlehlahte- Eliab’ tapate Dathan le Abiram, le Peleth’ tapa On- tam teng pui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a kikhawmte lah panin a kiteel mi minthang, mihonte’ makai Israel-te pasal zani le sawmnga tawh Moses ledo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses le Aaron langpang dingin amate a kikhawm vua, ama gel kungah, “Valkai ta luo gel teh! Mihonpi zosie a unpi-in a siengtho vua, amate lahah Topa om hi. A kikhawm Topa’ mihonte tungah bang dinga kitawisang tuom na hi uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses in tua thu a zah bepin a mai kunsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Korah le a pawlte zosie kungah, “Zing ciengin Topa in ama-a’ koi pen hi a, koi siengtho-in, ama kungah koi pei thei ding ahei ci ei theisah ding hi. Ama in a kungah a teel ding mipa peisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hici bawl un: Korah le na pawl zosie in gimnamtui halna beelte la unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />zing ciengin tuate sungah mei koi-in, Topa mai-ah tua meite tungah gimnamtui koi un. Topa in a teel mipa pen a siengtho hi ding hi. No Levi-te valkai ta luo uteh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Korah kungah, “No Levi-te aw, tu-in za un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa’ biehbuh nasep sem dinga ama kung neh thei dingin Israel’ Pasien in Israel mihonte lah panin note ang tuomkoi a, mihonpi mai-ah hing dingsahin amau’ na ang sepsah khu note dingin a thuneu na sa uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in a kungah nang le na sanggam Levi-te zosie hing peisah zo ta hi; hinanle nang in siempu nasep zong tu lai vaset ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa do dinga nangma le na pawl zosie ang kisutuo na hi uhi. Tam banga na phunsan nadingun Aaron bang hi mawh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses in Eliab’ tapa Dathan le Abiram hlan dingin mi sawl a, ahi vangin ama gel in, “Kang pei sih ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang in senel gamah thagam dingin bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna gam panin kote nei peipi a, ka tung vuah thunei vaihawm dinga na kibawl khu a thuneu na sa amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna gamah kote nei peipi sih a, ka gouluo dingun lengga umte le lote zong nei pieh lo lam kitel sieng ta hi. Tam mite’ mit kheudawh sawm na hi amah? Kang pei sih ding uhi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses thangpai mama a, Topa kungah, “A biehna uh thusimpieh sin. Amate tung panin laa khat zong ka la sih a, amate khat zong ka bawlsie sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moses in Korah kungah, “Nang le na pawl zosie, nang, amate le Aaron tawh zing ciengin Topa mai-ah na kilaa ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuale na milipun gimnamtui beel tawi ciet unlen a sungah gimnamtui koi-in, tuaci’n Topa’ mai-ah mi zosie in gimnamtui beel zani le sawmnga hing tawi un. Nangma le Aaron in zong na gimnamtui beel ciet hing kitawi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n mikim in a gimnamtui beel ciet tawi-in a sungah mei koi-in a tungah gimnamtui a koi vua, kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah Moses le Aaron tawh a dington uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Korah in Moses le Aaron do dingin kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah mihon zosie khawm hi. Topa’ vanglietna mihonte lahah kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses le Aaron hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bakhat sungin amate ka suhsiet thei nadingin tam mihonte lah panin kihem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate kunsuhin, “Pasien, mi zosie’ hlagau a pie Pasien aw, mi khat’ khielna ziehin mihon zosiepi tungah lungthah ding na mah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihonte kungah tam bangin gen in: Korah, Dathan, le Abiram-te’ tenna mun panin peidawh ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses dingin Dathan le Abiram kungah a pei hi; Israel’ upate in ama a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in mihonpite kungah, “Tam migilote’ puonbuh panin kihem dawh unlen, amau’ na bangma khat zong tham sih un. Na tham uleh amau’ khielna zosie ziehin ang kihemkhie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n Korah, Dathan, le Abiram-te’ tenna mun panin amate a peikhie uhi; Dathan le Abiram-te pusuohin a zite a tate ule a tasente utawh a puonbuh lutna vuah a dington uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuale Moses in, “Tami nasep pen keima thu-a ka bawl ahi sih a, Topa in tami nasep zosie a sem dinga kei ei sawl ahi lam tam bang tawh na thei ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam mite si ngaina banga ang si vua, ahi sihle mite’ tuo khah ngaite ma ang tuo vua ahile, Topa in kei ei sawl lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in thei ngai lo na khat piengsahin leitang in a kamkahin a neisa zosie utawh a valtum a, a hingtang vua Misikhuo-a a peipisuh leh, tam mite in Topa a simmaw lam na thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in tam thu teng a gen zaw behin a nei vuah lei a pawhkeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leitang in a kam kahin amate, a innkuonpite uh, Korah tawh a kipawl mi vannuoi le a neisa zosie valtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate le a neisa zosie utawh a hingtangun Misikhuo-ah a tumsuh uhi; leitang in amate khucipin mihonte lah panin a mangthai ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amau’ kikona ziehin a kimvel vua om Israel zosie taimang uhi. Azieh pen amate in, “Leitang in eite zong ei valtum kha va!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa kung panin mei lengkhie a, gimnamtui pie mi zani le sawmnga a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Siempu Aaron’ tapa Eleazar in meikuong sung panin gimnamtui beelte a lah dawh nadingin gen in; tua ciengin a gamlapi-ah tua mei thethang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amau’ hinna tawp za donga a khiel tam mite’ gimnamtui beelte siengtho hi. Tua gimnamtui beelte maitam sinna dankuong phengin kheng un, azieh pen amate in Topa mai-ah tuate a pieh zo tah ziehun tuate khu a siengtho ahi hi. Tua bangin Israel-te adingin tuate lim khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaci’n siempu Eleazar in mei in a kahtum mite’ pieh gimnamtui sumngo beelte a la hi; tuale maitam sinna-in tuate kikheng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Korah le a pawlte a bah lo nadingin Topa in Moses tungtawnin ama kungah a gen bangin Aaron’ suonlehlah ahi lo a pulam mipa in Topa mai-ah gimnamtui pie-a a pei lo nadingin tuate khu Israel-te tunga phawsahna khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hinanle a zing ciengin Israel mihonpi zosie in Moses le Aaron langpangin, “No gel in Topa’ mite na that sieng uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuale ama gel langpangin mihonpi a kikhop zo ciengun, kikhopna puonbuh lamah Moses le Aaron a khuodah uhi; meii in puonbuh tuom a, tuaci’n Topa’ minthanna a kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ciengin kikhopna puonbuh mai-ah Moses le Aaron a pei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in a kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Bakhat sungin amate ka suhsiet thei nadingin tam mihonpite lah panin peidawh ta’n,” a ci hi. Tuale ama gel a mai kunsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Moses in Aaron kungah, “Na gimnamtui beel la inlen a tungah maitam pana mei le gimnamtui koi in. Manlang tahin mihonte kungah tua khu tawi inlen amate dingin thoidamna bawlpieh in. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa kung panin lungthahna pusuoh zo a, gimna kipan zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses’ thupiehsa bangin Aaron in la-in mipite laikim-ah a tai hi. Mipite lahah gimna a kipan zo tahpi a, ama in gimnamtui koi-in mite adingin thoidamna a bawlpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A si le a hingte kikalah ama a ding hi; tuale gimna a veng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Korah tungtanga a site simlo, tam gimna tawh a si mi tul sawm le tulli le zasagi pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Gimna a ven zaw ciengin kikhopna puonbuh lutna Moses kungah Aaron a peikia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-te hopi inlen amau’ pupa innkuon sunga makai zosie tung panin amau’ pupa innkuon khat ciet dingin ciengkhut khat, ciengkhut sawm le ni la inlen, a ciengkhut ciet vuah a min ciet uh giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Levi’ ciengkhut tungah Aaron’ min giel in. Azieh pen a pupa innkuon lutang khat adingin ciengkhut khat ciet om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh sung, thuciemna mai, nangma kang kimupina munah tuate koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka teel mipa’ ciengkhut ang meng ding hi; tua bangin na tung vua Israel-te’ phun mielmuolna teng ka tawpsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in Israel-te a hopi hi; makaite zosie in a pupate’ innkuon zui-in makai khat ciengin khat ta, ama tungah ciengkhut sawm le ni a pie vua, Aaron’ ciengkhut zong amau’ ciengkhut lahah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n thuciemna puonbuh sung Topa mai-ah Moses in tua ciengkhutte a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zing ciengin thuciemna puonbuh sungah Moses a lut ciengin Levi innkuon adingin Aaron ciengkhut mengin na ngumin na pallun a, almond min ga na ga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Topa mai panin Israel zosie kungah ciengkhut zosie a peipi a, amate in enin a ciengkhut ciet uh a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale Topa in Moses kungah, “A ledo mite tungah hilkholna ahi ding le kei nei phunsan uh na tawp nadingun thuciemna mai-ah Aaron’ ciengkhut koikia un. Tua ahi sihle amate a si ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua bangin Moses in a bawl hi; Topa thupieh bang lien ma-in ama in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-te in Moses kungah, “A sigam ding ka hi ta uhi; kote a mangthai ding ka hi ta uhi; ka unpi-un a mangthai hi ta ung!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa’ biehbuh nai-a a pei poma a si ding hi. Tuale kote ka unpi vua sigam ding ka hi ta uh amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Aaron kungah tam bangin a gen hi: Mun siengtho tawh kisai-a mawsahna teng nang le na tapate le na pupa innkuonte in na puo ding vua, siempu nasepna tawh kisai-a mawsahna teng nang le na tapate beh in na puo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuciemna puonbuh mai-ah nang le na tapate na op laitahun no ang pawl ding le note’ na ang sep hu thei nadingun na pate nam ahi Levi minam na sanggamte zong zawpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in note’ nasep le puonbuh nasep zosie sem ding uhi. Ahi vangin mun siengtho ahi sihle maitam vanzahte nehin a pei sih ding uhi. A pei uleh amate le note na ni-un na si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in kikhopna puonbuh vaipuoh teng a sem dingin note hing pawlin kikhopna puonbuh nasep zosie sem ding uhi; a pulam mi koima in ang neh sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel-te tungah lungthahna a tun ngai nawn lo nadingin noma ma in mun siengtho nasepte le maitam nasepte na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in Israel-te lah pan na sanggam uh Levi-te a la pa keima ka hi hi; tu-in ahile amate pen kikhopna puonbuh nasep a sem dinga Topa tunga kipumpieh noma’ letsong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang le na tapate in maitam tawh kisai na zosie le dalna puon sunga om na zosie-ah na siempu nasep uh kintahin na sem ding uhi. Na siempu nasep uh pen letsong-a kang pieh ahi hi; ang nai a pulam mi poma kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Aaron tam bangin a hopi hi: Keima tunga ei kipie biehnate ahi Israel-te’ letsong siengthote a sai dingin nang kang koi zo hi; nang tung le na tapate tungah siempu tanh ahi zing dingin tuate kang pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mei tawh a kihal dingte lah panin nang dinga a kihen, a siengtho pen nate in: sil siengtho pena kei kunga ei pieh uh a biehna zosie uh, an tawh biehna, mawna zieha biehna, le khielna zieha biehnate, nang le na tapate-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A siengtho pen na khat bangin tuate na ne ding uhi; pasal kici poma in ne thei ding hi; tua khu note dingin a siengtho hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam zong khu noma-a’ ahi hi: Israel-te’ a kivei biehna letsongte zosie sung panin a kituomkoi poma nang le na tapate le na tanute’ kaih ahi zing dingin tuate kang pie hi; na inn sunga a siengtho mi popo in ne thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in sathau tuituoh pen teng, lenggazu le an a tuituoh pen teng, Topa tunga amau’ pieh a tuituoh pen ante, note kang pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa tunga a tawi uh, a leitang vua a pieng ga masa zosie noma-a’ hi ding hi; na inn sunga om a siengtho mi popo in ne thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel-te sunga ki-ap na vannuoi noma-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa tunga kipie naubu phukeh masa zosie, mihing hile ganhing hile noma-a’ hi ding hi; hizongle mihing tacil pen khu na tanh ding vua, ganhing sieng lo tacil zong na tanh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hla khat pana kituot tuate tatman pen mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in ngun shekel nga-in na se ding uhi. (tua khu gerah sawmni ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin bawng tacil, ahi sihle tuu tacil, ahi sihle keel tacilte na tanh sih ding uhi; tuate a siengtho ahi hi. Maitam tungah tuate na the ding vua, Topa tungah a gimnamtui, mei tawh kihal biehna-in tuate’ thau na hal ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />hizongle a kivei a awmsa le a mal zietlam khu noma-a’ ahi ma bangin a sate zong noma-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa tunga Israel-te in a pieh a siengtho biehna zosie, keima in nang le na tapate le na tanute tungah na kaih zing ding vua kang pieh ahi hi; tami khu nang le na suonlehlahte adingin zong ci tawh Topa mai-a tawntung thuciemna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Aaron kungah tam bangin a gen hi: Amau’ gamah luo na nei sih ding a, amate lahah bangma tanh zong na nei sih ding hi; nangma’ tanh keima ka hi a, Israel-te lahah nangma’ luo ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh sungah keima in a na sepna uh ka thuhkiana-in Israel gam sunga sawm-ah-khat zosie amau’ luo dingin Levi-te tungah ka pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu-a kipanin Israel-te kikhopna puonbuh-ah a pei nawn sih ding vua, a pei teitei uleh khielna bawlin a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Levi-te in kikhopna puonbuh sunga nasep a sem ding vua, a khielna paat uh a puo ding uhi; tua khu na khang tawntung vua ngaina kip khat hi ding hi. Ahi vangin amate in Israel-te lahah tanh nei lo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Topa tungah biehna dinga a tuomkoi uh Israel-te’ sawm-ah-khat pen amau’ tanh dingin Levi-te tungah ka pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Levi-te hopi inlen tam bangin na gen ding hi: Keima in Israel-te tung panin na tanh ding vua kang pieh ahi sawm-ah-khat na san ciengun, tua sung panin Topa tungah biehna-in sawm-ah-khat sung panin sawm-ah-khat ma na khensawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua na silpiehte uh, ancilna pana an le lengga suhna pana kipie bangin noma’ letsongin kiciemte ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Note in zong Israel-te tung pana na san uh sawm-ah-khat zosie lah panin Topa tungah biehna-in tam bangin na khenkhie ding uhi; tuate sung panin siempu Aaron tungah Topa’ biehna na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na tung vua ang kipie letsong zosiete lah panin Topa ading biehna zosie na tuomkoi ding uhi; tuate zosie lah panin a hoi pente na siensuo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate kungah zong tam bangin gen in: Tuate lah panin a hoi pente na tuomkoi zaw ciengun, a omlai teng pen Levi-te adingin ancilna phuol pan le lengga suhna pana a piengin kisimpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nang le na innkuonpite in mun khat popo-ah na ne thei ding uhi; azieh pen tua khu kikhopna buh sunga na nasep thaman uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuate lahah a hoi pen na pieh ciengun tam thu ziehin mawsahna na thuoh sih ding uhi. Ahi vangin sina na thuoh lo nadingun Israel-te’ letsong siengtho na buasah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ thupieh thukham le ngainate tam bang ahi hi: Na kung vuah poina a nei lo, nuol a baang lo, a tunga hahkol kivaw nai lo, bawnglaa a san khat ang peipi nadingun Israel-te kungah gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siempu Eleazar tungah tua khu na pie ding vua, giephuol pulamah kikai-in ama’ mai-ah kigo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siempu Eleazar in a khutme tawh a si kimkhat la ding a, kikhopna puonbuh mai lamah tua a si sagivei the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin a muna-ah tua bawnglaa kihal dinghi; a vun, a tel, le a site, a eh tawh kihaltha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siempu pa in taamtah sing le hyssop le puon ausan khat la-in bawngla kihalna munah sepsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu pa in a puonte sawpin tui sungah kipumsil ding a, tua zaw ciengin giephuolah pei thei ding hi; ahi vangin nitah dongin siempu pa abua hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawnglaa a hal mipa in a puonte tui sungah sawpin tui sungah kipumsil ding hi; nitah dongin ama abua hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin a siengtho mi khat in tua bawnglaa kihalna vutvam khawmin giephuol pulam a sieng mun khatah khol ding hi; Israel mihonpite’ kisiensuona tui-a zah dingin kikoicing ding hi. Tam pen siensuo biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawnglaa kihalna vutvam khawm pa in a puonte sawp ding a, nitah dongin abua hi ding hi. Tam pen Israel-te le amate lahah a teng pemtate tungah kumtawn ngaina khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Misi luong khatpo a thamkha mite ni sagi sung abua hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ni thum ni le a ni sagi ni-in tui tawh kisiensuo-in, tuaci’n amate a siengtho hi ding hi; ahi vangin a ni thum ni le a ni sagi ni-in a kisiensuo sih uleh, a sieng suoh thei lo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misi khat thamkha poma le a sisate’ luong a thamkha a kisiensuo lo poma Topa’ biehbuh a buasah ahi hi; Israel lah panin tua bang mite kihemkhie ding hi. Amate tungah siensuona tui kithe lo ahi ziehin abua-in a om suoh ding uhi; amau’ sienlona pen a tung vuah a baang lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam khu puonbuh sunga mi khat a si cienga zah ding thukham ahi hi: Puonbuh sunga a tum zosie le puonbuh sunga om mi zosie ni sagi sung abua hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tunga asin kikhu lo umlebeel poma a sieng lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Namsau tawh gamlaha kithat mi ahi a, ahi sihle si ngaina-a si ahi zongin, misi gu ahi a, ahi sihle han ahi zongin a thamkha poma ni sagi sung abua hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abua mipa adingin a kihal siensuo biehna vutvamte la-in beel sung khatah tui luonglai tawh hal ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tua ciengin a sieng mi khat in hyssop la-in tui sungah die ding a, puonbuh tung, vanzah zosie tung, tua sunga om mi zosie tung le misi gu, a kithat mi, misi, ahi sihle han ahi zongin a tham mi poma tungah the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ni thum ni le a ni sagi ni-in a sieng mipa in a sieng lo mipa tungah the ding a, tua bangin a ni sagi ni-in amate siensuo ding hi. Tua ciengin a puonte uh sawpin tui sungah a kipumsil ding vua, nitah ciengin a sieng ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abua hi napi amau le amau a kisiensuo lo mite pen Topa’ mun siengtho a buasah ahi ziehun mihonpi lah panin tua mite kihemkhie ding hi. A tung vuah siensuona tui kithe lo ahi ziehin abua ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua khu amate dingin kumtawna kizang ding thukham khat hi ding hi. Siensuona tui a the pa in a puonte sawp ding a, tua siensuona tui a thamkha poma nitah dongin abua hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abua mipa’ thamkhah na khat popo abua hi ding a, tua na a thamkha mi popo zong nitah dongin abua hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hla masa penin Zin gamlah-ah Israel mihonpi zosie a tung vua, Kadesh-ah a om uhi. Khum munah Miriam si a, khum mun ma-ah kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu-in mihonpi ading tui a om sih hi; tuaci’n Moses le Aaron langpang dingin amate a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses tawh mite kihau-in, “ Topa mai-a i sanggamte a na si lai-un eite zong na kisidawh tazaw leih izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bang dinga kote le ka ganhingte a siton dinga Topa’ mihonte, tami mun gamlaha nei peipi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bang dingin Egypt gam panin tami sietna mun tut dinga nei peipito ahei? An ahi a, thei ahi a, lenggui ahi a, mang kawlsing ahi zongin a opna mun a hi sih hi; tui dawn ding nasan a om sih hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin mihonte lah panin kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah Moses le Aaron a pei uhi. Ama gel zong a kunsuh vua, tuaci’n a tung vuah Topa’ vanglietna kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ciengkhut la-in, nang le na sanggampa Aaron in mihonte khawm unlen, a mitmu vua suongpi in tui a pulsah nadingin tua suongpi thupie un; tua bangin suongpi panin a dawn ding uh tui na pie ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama’ thupiehsa bangin Moses in Topa mai-ah ciengkhut a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses le Aaron in suongpi mai-ah mihonte kaikhawmin a kung vuah, “Ngai un, no langpangte aw, tami suongpi panin note ding tui kang pulsah ding uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in a khut lamto-in a ciengkhut tawh tua suongpi nivei a sat hi; tui tampitah pulkhie-in mihonte le ganhingte in a dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in Moses le Aaron kungah, “Israel-te muna-ah keima in ka sienthona ka lah thei nadingin nei muon lo zieh gelin amate ka piehsa gam sungah tam mihonte na tunpi sih ding gel hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam teng pen, Meribah tui phuola Topa tawh Israel-te a kiselna, amate lahah amama a siengtho-a a kilahna muna thupieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses in Kadesh panin Edom kumpipa kungah kamtaite sawl a, “Na sanggampa Israel in tam bangin a gen hi: Nangma in ka tung vua ang tungsa hahsatna zosie na thei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt-ah ka pu ka pate a na peisuh vua, tuaci’n Egypt-ah sauveipi ka na teng uhi; Egypt mite in ko le ka pu ka pate ei na bawlsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa kungah ka kiko ciengun ama in ka aw uh ei za a, vantungmi khat hing sawlin Egypt panin ei peipi a, tu-in nangma’ gam ning Kadesh khuo-ah ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu-in na gam ei nawhsah in. Lolai hile, lengga umte hile ka nawhkha sih ding vua, tuikhuh khatpo-a tui zong ka mawh dawn sih ding uhi; Kumpipa’ Lamlienpi dung zui-in ka pei ding vua, na gam sung ka kal masangun ziet le vei-ah ka piel sih ding uhi,” a cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin Edom in ama kungah, “Ka gam sung na nawh thei sih ding uhi; nang nawh paupau uleh no ang do dingin namsau tawh kang kuon ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel-te in, “Lamlienpi tawnin ka peito ding uhi; ko le ka ganhingte in na tui uh ka dawn uleh a manh kang pie ding uhi. Tam pen thu neuno khat ahi lel bo hi; keng tawh ei nawhsah maimai in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “Na nawh thei sih ding uhi,” a ci hi. Edom mite, galkap tampi le galvan tampi tawh amate do dingin a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua bangin Edom mite in a gam uh nawh ding a phal sih uhi; tuaci’n amate kung panin Israel mite a kiheikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kadesh panin a ding vua, Hor muol-ah Israel mipi buppi a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Edom gamgi Hor muol-a Moses le Aaron kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Aaron a mite kung zuonsah ta gel in. Bang ding ahei cile Meribah tuiphuol-ah no gel in ka thupieh nei ledo zieh gelin Israel mite tunga ka piehsa leitangah ama lut lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aaron le a tapa Eleazar zawpi inlen, Hor muol-ah peipi to in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aaron puonsilte suodawh inlen a tapa Eleazar silsah in. Ahi vangin Aaron a mite kungah kigawm ta ding a, khum munah si ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa’ thupieh bangin Moses gamta a, mihonte’ mitmu-in amate Hor muol-ah a kato uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses in Aaron’ puonte suopiehin a tapa Eleazar silsah hi; tuale tua muol dawnah Aaron a si hi. Muol dawn panin Moses le Eleazar a kumsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mihon buppi in Aaron si a mu bepun Aaron ziehin Israel’ innkuon sung mi zosie ni sawmthum sung a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Canaan-te Negeb gama teng Arad kumpipa in Atharim lam zui-in Israel-te pei ci thu a zah ciengin ama in Israel-te na do a, pawlkhat salin man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te in Topa tungah kiciemna khat a bawl vua, “Ka khut sung vuah tam mite nei pieh tahtah leh amau’ khuopite ka susie ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in Israel-te’ thugen ngai-in Canaan-te a pie hi; tuale amate in a khuopite le amate a susie uhi; tuaci’n khum mun pen Hormah kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hor Muol panin dingkhie-in Edom kimvela pei dingin San Tuipi zotna lampi a zui vua, hinanle lamkim-ah mite a lungkie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mite in Pasien le Moses a gensie vua, “Bang dingin senel gama si dingin Egypt panin ei peipito na hei? An le tui lah om lo, bangma man lo tami an zong ka kidah uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in mite lahah gul guphate hla a, tuate in mite tu-in Israel-te tampitah a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moses kungah mite pei-in, “ Topa le nangma hing langpangin kampau kha ka hi ziehun ka maw uhi. Ka kung panun tam gulte a lah dawh nadingin Topa tungah thungen in,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n Moses in mite adingin thu ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Gul gupha khat’ lim bawl inlen khuom tung khatah khai in. Gul in a tuh mi poma khumi a en ding vua, a hing ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in sumngo gul khat bawlin khuom tung khatah a khai hi. Gul in mi khatpo a tuh sielin ama in tua sumngo gul enin a hing pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel-te dingkhie-in Oboth-ah giephuol sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Oboth panin a dingkhie vua, nisuona lam Moab gamgi-a om senel gam, Iye-abarim munah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum mun panin dingkhie-in Zered Kuom-ah a gieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum panin a dingkhie vua, Amor-te’ gamgi pana kihlungsuh senel gam sung Arnon gun galkhatah giephuol a sat uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Arnon gun pen Moab-te le Amor-te kikala om Moab-te’ gamgi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa’ Gal Dona Laibu sungah, “Suphah gama Wahep khuo le a luite. Arnon gun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />le Ar mun dong a bansuh, Moab gamgi dunga kihlung, Arnon le guom kente,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum panin Beer munah a pei uhi; khum mun pen Topa in Moses kungah, “Mite kaikhawm inlen amate tui ka pie ding hi,” a cina tuikhuh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te in tam la a sa uhi: “Tuikhuh aw, phul in! Tuami adingin la sa un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpi ciengkhut le amau’ ciengkhutte tawh, makaite in a na taw, miliente in a na taw tuikhuh aw,” a ci uhi. Senel gam panin Mattanah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mattanah panin Nahaliel, Nahaliel panin Bamoth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bamoth panin gamgawta kimusuh theina Pisgah muol dawn gei, Moab gam sunga kihlungsuh kuom khatah a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te in Amor kumpipa Sihon kungah kamtaite sawlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Na gam nawhin ei peisah in; lolai ahi a, lengga huon ah ahi zongin ka piel sih ding uhi; tuikhuh khatpo-a tuite zong ka dawn sih ding uh; na gam sung ka kal masangsie-un Kumpipa’ Lamlienpi-ah ka pei ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hizongle Sihon in Israel-te a gam nawhsah ding a phal sih hi. Sihon in a mite zosie kaikhawm a, Israel-te do dingin senel gamah a kuon hi; Jahaz mun-ah ama tungin Israel-te a do hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel-te in namsau tawh ama thatin Arnon panin Jabbok dong, Ammon-te opna dongin a gam a lahpieh uhi; azieh pen Ammon-te’ gamgi a thahat mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel-te in tam khuopi zosie a la vua, Heshbon gam sunga Amor-te’ khuopi zosie le a khuotate zosie-ah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Heshbon pen Moab kumpi masa pa simin Arnon cieng dong a gam zosie a na lahpieh Amor-te’ kumpipa Sihon’ khuopi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin lasate in, Heshbon-ah hing pei un. Lamkia unlen Sihon’ khuopi kipsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Azieh pen Heshbon panin mei pusuoh a, Sihon khuopi panin meikuong pusuoh hi. Moab-te’ khuopi Ar le Arnon muolsang a uhte a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moab aw, vangsie ma cia! Chemosh mite aw, a kisie hi ta uteh! Ama’n Amor kumpipa Sihon kungah a tapate galtai-in bawl a, a tanute galmatin a omsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n amau’ suon le hlahte Heshbon panin Dibon dongin a kisie vua, mei in Medeba cieng dong a bat masang ka siesah uhi,” ci-in sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua bangin Amor-te’ gamah Israel-te a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Moses in Jazer khuo thu kansim dingin mi a sawl hi; tuale amate in a khuotate la-in khum muna na omsa Amor-te a suon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kihei-in Bashan lampi-ah a peito uhi; tuale amate do dingin Bashan kumpipa Og le a mi zosie Edrei-ah a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanle Topa in Moses kungah, “Ama giing sin; azieh pen na khut sungah ama’ mi zosie le ama’ leitang zosie kang pie zo hi. Heshbon a uh Amor kumpipa Sihon tunga na bawl bang ma-in ama tungah zong na bawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaci’n a hing khat zong a om nawn lo za dongin ama le a tapate le a mite zosie a that uhi; tuale amate in ama’ gam luo uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te vai a ding vua, Jericho gei Jordan gungal Moab zanglei-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zippor’ tapa Balak in Israel-te in Amor-te tunga a bawl teng zosie mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate a tam seng ziehun Moab-te in tua mite a giing mama uhi; Israel-te a giin ziehun Moab-te a zausi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab-te in Midian upate kungah, “Bawngtang in lolai-a lopa a lie bangin tam mipite in tu-in i kimvel vua om zosie a liehtum ding ahi ta uhi,” a ci uhi. Zippor’ tapa Balak pen khum hun laitahin Moab kumpipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Amaw gama om Euphrates gun gei Pethor khuo-a teng Beor’ tapa Balaam kungah kamtai sawl a, “Egypt gam panin mihon khat ang pei uhi; lei maitang tengah a kithezah vua, kei banah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei sanga a thahat zawh ziehun tu-in hing pei inlen tam mite ei samsietpieh in; tua hile amate ka zo kha thei ding a, khum gam panin ka notmang zo kha thei ding hi; azieh pen na thupha pieh poma in thupha nga a, na samsiet poma samsietin a om hi, ci ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moab upate le Midian upate in a khut sung vuah aisan man ding tawi-in a kuonkhie uhi; Balam kungah amate tungin Balak’ thu vaihlah teng a sung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Tu zanin tanah gieh unlen, kei tunga Topa in ei hopi bang lienin na kung vuah thu kang puohkia ding hi,” a ci hi; tuaci’n Balaam kungah Moab uliente a gieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Balaam kungah Pasien pei-in, “Nang tawh a omton tam mite koi ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Balaam in Pasien kungah, “Moab kumpipa Zippor’ tapa Balak in ka kungah tam bangin mi ang sawl hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Egypt panin mihon khat ang pei vua, lei maitang tengah a kithezah uhi; tu-in hing pei inlen, tam mite ei samsietpieh in; tua hile keima in amate simin ka notmang zo kha thei ding hi,’ ei ci hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pasien in Balaam kungah, “Amate na zui sih ding hi; tua mite na samsie sih ding hi, azieh pen amate thupha kipie ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n zingmawng ciengin Balaam tho a, Balak’ uliente kungah, “Na gam ciet vuah pei ta un, azieh pen Topa in note tawh zawton ding ei phal lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moab uliente dingkhie-in Balak kungah a pei vua, “Balaam in kote ei zui nuom lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Balak in tuate sanga a tamzaw le a zatahhuoizaw uliente khatvei sawlkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Balaam kungah amate a tung vua, a kungah, “Zippor’ tapa Balak in tam bangin gen hi: ‘Kei kunga nang pei ding bangma in kikai-awhsah sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />azieh pen patawina lienpi kang pie valon ding a, ka kunga nang gen popo kang bawlpieh ding hi. Hing pei inlen tam mite ei samsietpieh in,’ ci hi,” ci-in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hizongle Balaam in Balak’ nasemte kungah, “Balak in ngun le kham a inndim ei pie ding hi phiel le zong Topa’ thupieh kalvalin a tawmzaw ahi a, a tamzaw ahi zongin ka bawl thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in kei kungah bang thu ang genbe lai diei mah ci thu ka thei nadingin adangte ma bangin tuzan tanah gieh tadi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khum zanin Balaam kungah Pasien pei-in, “Nang ang hlan dinga tua mite ang pei ahi uleh tho inlen zui in; ahi vangin kang sawlte beh bawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n zingmawngin Balaam tho a, a laaphaw pha-in Moab lamkaite tawh a zawhton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama a pei ziehin Pasien lungthah mama a, ama do dingin Topa’ vantungmi lampi ah na pang hi. A laa tungah ama tuong a, a nasemte ni a zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua laa in a khut sungah namsau dawsa-in lampi-a a ding Topa’ vantungmi a mu hi; tuaci’n lampi panin tua laa pielin gamlahah a pei hi; tuale Balaam in lampi-a a peikia nadingin a laa a sat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin lengga lo kikal, a pang tuohah phung a opna lam kawcih laitahah Topa’ vantungmi na ding leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Laa in Topa’ vantungmi a mu ciengin phungbang phu-in tua tawh Balaam’ keng a gawtkha hi; tuaci’n ama in a laa a satkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin a masangah Topa’ vantungmi na pei-in zietlam ahi a, veilam ahi zongin kihei nading om lona mun kawcih khatah na ding leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Laa in Topa’ vantungmi a mu bepin Balaam’ nei-ah a lumsuh hi; tuale Balaam lungthah mama a, a ciengkhut tawh a laa a sat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in a laa kam a honpieh a, Balaam kungah, “Thumvei tahpi nei sat va-ia nadingin nang bang kang law ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Balaam in a laa kungah, “Nang in kei nei motbawl zieha khu! Ka khut sungah namsau tawi poma leng maw! Kang tha pai lien ding a khula!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin laa in Balaam kungah, “Na khang tungtawnin tuni dong na tuonna na laa hi lo ka mah? Na tungah tam bang danin kang bawl ngai ta amah?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Ei bawl ngai sih teh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Balaam’ mit a honpieh a, ama in a khut sungah namsau dawsa-in lampi-a a ding Topa’ vantungmi a mu hi; tuale ama zong a lu kunin lei-ah a bawhsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi in ama kungah, “Bang dinga na laa thumveitah na sat ahiei? Nangma’ lampi pen ka mai-ah letatna ahi ziehin nang ang langpang dinga ang kuon ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Laa in kei ei mu-in thumvei dong ei pel hi. Ei pel lo khat hi poma leh tu mama-in kang that zo tahtah ta ding a, na laa ka suohtasah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin Balaam in Topa’ vantungmi kungah, “Kei ei pang dingin lampi-ah na din ding lam ka thei lo ziehin ka khiel zo hi. Tua ahi ziehin kei tungah na lungkim sih leh tu-in inn lam ka kilekia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi in Balaam kungah, “Tua mite tawh zawh in; hizongle kang sawl teng beh na gen ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Balak uliente tawh Balaam a zawhton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Balaam ang pei zo ta ci thu Balak in a zah ciengin gamgi mong a gamla pena a om, Arnon in gamgi-a a bawl mun Ir-moab-ah ama tawh kimu dingin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Balak in Balaam kungah, “Nang ang hlan dingin mi hing sawl hi lo ka mah? Bang dinga ka kunga hing pei lo na hei? Nang ang patawi la ding ka hi amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Balaam in Balak kungah, “Tu-in na kung kang tung zo hi. Ahi vangin thu khatpo ka gen thei nading ken thu ka nei amah? Ka kam sunga kikoi Pasien’ thute beh a gen ding ka hi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ciengin Balak tawh Balaam zawh a, Kiriath-huzoth khuo-ah a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bawngtangte le tuute tawh Balak kithoi a, Balaam le a ompi uliente kungah tuate a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A zing ciengin Balak in Balaam zawpi a, Bamoth-baal munah a peipito hi; tuale ama in khum mun panin Israel mite pawlkhat a mu thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Balaam in Balak kungah, “Kei adingin tami munah maitam sagi ei lampieh inlen, bawngtang sagi le tuutang sagi ei pie’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Balaam gen bangin Balak gamta a, Balak le Balaam in maitam khatah bawngtang khat le tuutang khat ta a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Balaam in Balak kungah, “Kei ka va pei kalin tami mun na meihal biehnate gei-ah na om in. Kei ei dawn dingin Topa ang pei kha ding hi. Ama in kei ei lah popo na kungah kang gen ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin muolvum pawn gawta tung khatah ama a kato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in Balaam kimupi a, Balaam in ama kungah, “Maitam sagi ka siem zo ta a, maitam simah bawngtang khat le tuutang khat ta ka pie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Balaam’ kam sungah thu khat koi a, ama kungah, “Balak kungah peikia inlen tam bangin na gen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Balak kunga a kilekia ciengin ama le Moab ulien zosie tawh ama’ meihal biehna gei-ah na ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Balaam in a thuphuon tam bangin a gen hi: Balak in Aram panin keima ei peipi zo ta a, nisuona muolte panin Moab kumpipa in keima ei peipi hi: ‘Hing pei inlen, Jacob ei samsietpieh in. Hing pei inlen Israel mite hing hosie in!’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien in a samsiet lo mite bangci samsiet thei ding ka hei? Topa in a hosiet lo mite bangci hosiet thei ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile suongpi dawn panin ama ka mu a, muoltangte tung panin ama ka en hi. A tuomten minam khat om a, tuate khu minamte lahah kisim kha lo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jacob’ leivui khu koi in sim zo-in, ahi sihle Israel’ meii-leivui khu koi in sim zo ding ahei? Mi dih pa’ sina bangin keima ei sisah inlen, ka hun tawpna ding zong ama-a’ bangsah in!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Balak in Balaam kungah, “Kei bang nei law ta e? Ka galte samsie dinga kang zawpi hi bo a, tu-in nang in amate bangma na law lo banah thupha na pie zawsop hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in dawng a, “ Topa in gen dinga ka kam sunga a koi thu don loin ka koi ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n Balak in ama kungah, “Khum mun panin amate na mu thei nadingin mundang khatah ei zui in; amate a unpi-un na mu sih ding a, khenkhat beh na mu thei ding hi; tua ciengin khum mun panin amate ei samsietpieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in Zophim gamlah Pisgah muol vumah ama a zawpi hi. Ama in maitam sagi lam a, maitam simah bawngtang khat le tuutang khat ta a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Balaam in Balak kungah, “ Topa tawh khum muna ka va kimu kalun na meihal biehnate gei tam munah na ding in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Balaam va kimupi-in a kam sungah thu koi-in ama kungah, “Balak kungah peikia in. Na gen ding thu tam teng ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama kungah a tun ciengin a meihal biehnate gei-ah Moab uliente tawh ama na ding a, Balak in ama kungah, “ Topa in bang thu ang gen ei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Balaam in a thuphuon tam bangin a gen hi: “Balak aw, tho inlen ngai in. Zippor’ tapa aw, ka thu gen ngai in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zuou a gen dingin Pasien khu mihing ahi sih a, a lungsim khel dingin ama mihing hi lo hi. Ama in kamciem zo a, tua khu a sem sih ding amah? Ama’n gen zo hi, tua khu tangtun lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />En in, kei in thupha pieh nading thupiehna ka nga hi. Ama’n thupha pie zo a, ken ka dawhkia thei ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in Jacob tungah vangsietna a mu sih a; ama in Israel-te lahah gimna zong a mu sih hi. Topa amau’ Pasien, amate tawh a omton a, amate lahah ama pen kumpipa ci-in kitangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Egypt panin amate a peipi Pasien khu amate adingin gam bawngtang’ kite tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A tahtahin ci leih Jacob do nading bum a om sih a, Israel-te do nadingin aisanna a om sih hi; tu-in Israel le Jacob tungah, ‘Pasien in a bangci sep ahei mu un,’ kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />En un, humpi api bangin mite a thoto vua, humpi bangin a dieng vazawh uhi! A samatsa a neh masang, a savai’ si a dawn masang, a lum sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Balak in Balaam kungah, “Amate samsie poma sin len, thupha zong pie poma sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin Balaam in Balak kungah, “ Topa’ gen popo ka bawl ding hi,’ ang ci hi lo ka mah?” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n Balak in Balaam kungah, “Tu-in hing pei in, mun dangah kang peipi ding hi. Khum mun panin amate nei samsietpieh nading Pasien in ang lungkimpi kha ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Balak in gam gawta kimusuhna Peor muol dawnah Balaam zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Balaam in Balak kungah, “Tami munah kei dingin maitam sagi ei lampieh inlen, bawngtang sagi le tuutang sagi ei pie’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n Balaam ci bangin Balak gamta a, maitam simah bawngtang khat le tuutang khat ta a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Israel-te thupha pieh ding Topa a lungkim lam Balaam in mu a, tuaci’n a hun dangte bangin aisan dingin a kuon nawn sih a, ahi vangin senel gam lam a maingat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Balaam a khuodah leh Israel-te a bebe-in giephuol sata om a mu hi. Tua ciengin a tungah Pasien’ hlagau tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama in a thuphuon tam bangin a gen hi: Beor’ tapa Balaam’ thuphuon, a mit ciim khuomu theipa’ thuphuon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien’ thute a za pa’ thuphuon, Vanglienpa’ mangmu pa thuphuon, lum hit hiet napi a mit siing lo pa’ thuphuon:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jacob aw, na puonbuhte bang za-in etlawm a, Israel aw, na giephuolte bangza-in hoi ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A gamlapi-a kihlung, lutu singna tawh kibang a, gun gei-a om umte tawh kibang hi. Topa suonsa aloes panamtui kungte tawh kibang a, lui gei-a po taamtah kungte tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A phelkhai sung panin tui luong ding a, ama’ khaici in tui nieng tahin nga-in, a kumpipa uh Agag sangin thupizaw ding a, ama’ kumpi gam khu a kitawisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Egypt pana amate a peipi Pasien khu amate adingin gam bawngtang’ kite tawh a kibang hi. Ama in a galte ahi minamte valmangin, ama in a gu a tangte a hliehtawng ding hi. Ama in a thaltang tawh amate a kap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Humpi apa bangin bawhin a lumsuh hi. Humpi anu bangin ama a lumsuh hi. Koi in ama khu phong ngam ding ahei? Nang thupha ang pie poma in thupha nga hinlen, nang ang samsie poma in samsiet nga taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Balaam tungah Balak lungthahin a khuttum a ziel hi. Balak in Balaam kungah, “Ka galte samsie dinga kang hlat ahi a, ahi vangin nang in amate thumvei tah thupha na pie zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in na inn ah kipei ta’n! ‘Patatman tampitah hing pie vang,’ kang ci ngel hiven, hinanle Topa in na patatman ang khahtan hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Balaam in Balak kungah, “Keima kunga nang sawl na kamtaite kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘Balak in kham le ngun inndim khat ei pie phiel nanle Topa’ gen kalvalin kei dei bangin a sie ahi a, a pha ahi zongin ka bawl thei sih hi; Topa’ gente beh ka gen ding hi,’ ci-in gen zo hi lo ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu-in ka mite kungah ka pei ding hi; nidang hun ciengin tam mite in na mite tungah bang teng bawl ding uh ahei, ci thu kang kikuppi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a thuphuon tam bangin a gen hi: “Beor’ tapa Balaam’ thuphuon, a mit ciim khuomu theipa’ thuphuon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien’ thu a za pa’ thuphuon, Sangpen Pa’ pilna a thei pa’ thuphuon, Vanglienpa’ mangmu pa thuphuon, ama puasuhin, hinanle a mit siing lo pa’ thuphuon:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ke’n ama ka mu a, ahi vangin tu hi nai lo hi; ke’n ama ka en a, ahi vangin ama nai pah nai lo hi. Jacob sung pan aasi khat ang suoh ding a, Israel sung pan kumpi ciengkhut khat ang pieng ding hi. Tua in Moab’ gamgi dung teng satguoi ding a, ama in Seth-te’ gam zosie satcim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Edom pen mi’ neisa suoh ding a, Seir zong a galte’ neisa a suoh ding hi. Tua laitahin Israel mite in hangsan tahin sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jacob sung panin uhpa khat ang pieng ding a, Ir khuopi sunga a suohtate kisusie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Amalek gam enin, a thuphuon tam bangin a gen hi: “Amalek, mi namte lahah a masa pen ahi a, ahi vangin a tawpna-ah kumtawn manthaina a thuoh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Ken mite enin, a thuphuon tam bangin a gen hi: Na tenna munkip ahi a, suongpi kawmah na bu kikoi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ahi vangin Ken ahile haltum dinga kisesa ahi hi. Asshur in bang tanvei galmatin ang nei ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in thuphuon tam teng a genkia hi: “Kadei sei! Pasien in tamte a sep cieng, koi hing zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin Kittim panin tembawte ang pei-in Asshur le Eber genthei bawl ding hi; ama zong kumtawnin mangthai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Balaam tho-in a inn ah kilekia a, Balak zong a lampi-ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shittim-ah Israel-te a op laita hun mite in Moab numeite tawh numei-pasal pahtatna a kipan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam numeite in amau’ pasien biehpiehna-ah mi a ciel vua, mite in an ne-in amau’ pasien-te mai-ah a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua bangin Peor-ah Baal tawh Israel-te a na kizom vua, tuaci’n Israel-te tungah Topa’ lungthahna a kuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Israel-te kung pan a zauhuoi Topa’ lungthahna a kihei nadingin mipi lamkai zosie man inlen, Topa mai-ah suntang laipi-in khailia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses in Israel thukhente kungah, “Peor-a Baal tawh a kizom na mite uh koipo na that ciet ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zaw lien ciengin kikhopna buh tunkotah amate kapin a op laitahun Moses’ muna le Israel mihon buppi’ muna-ah Israel-te khat pei-in a innkuonpite kungah Midian numei khat a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siempu Aaron’ tapa, Eleazar’ tapa Phinehas in a mu ciengin dingin mihonte lah panin a peikhie hi. A khut sungah teipi khat tawi-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mipa puonbuh sungah nuadel a, Israel mipa le a numei, a ni gelin a gilpi pailetin a dawtlia hi. Tuaci’n Israel mite lah panin gimna a veng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua gimna tawh a si mimal tul sawmni le tulli pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Siempu Aaron’ tapa, Eleazar’ tapa Phinehas in Israel-te tunga ka lungthahna damsahkia zo hi. Keima in pamai ka sah bangin ama in pamai sa ahi ziehin pamai ka sahna tawh Israel-te ka susie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin, ‘Ka thuciem ahi nopsahna ama ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a Pasien adingin pawnthaw tahin a na pan zieh le Israel-te adingin thoidamna a na bawl ziehin, tua khu ama le ama zaw-a a suonlehlahte adingin tawntung siempu hina thuciemna hi ding hi,’ ci-in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Midian numei tawh a kithatton Israel mipa’ min pen Simeon-te’ pupa innkuon lutang Salu’ tapa Zimri ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kithat Midian numei nu’ min pen Midian-te’ innkuon pana pupa innkuon lutang Zur’ tanu Cozbi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Midian-te genthei bawl inlen amate zo gawp in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />azieh pen amate in a khelpilna utawh note ang gimsah gawp vua, Peor tawh kisai thu le Peor ziehin gimna ni-a a kithat, amau’ sanggamnu, Midian ulien khat’ tanu Cozbi thu-ah note ang sol uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pul natna zaw ciengin Topa in Moses le siempu Aaron’ tapa Eleazar kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A kikhawm Israel mipi buppi kum sawmni pan a tungsie, amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in Israel sung panin paltan tum thei ding poma sim in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses le siempu Eleazar in Jericho galkhat Jordan gun gei, Moab zanglei-ah amate tawh kiho a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin, “Kum sawmni pan a tungsie teng sim un,” a ci hi. Egypt gam pan a a pei Israel-te:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel’ ta masa Reuben ahi hi. Reuben’ suonlehlahte: Hanoch pan Hanoch bete; Pallu pan Pallu bete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hezron pan Hezron bete; Carmi pan Carmi bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tam teng khu Reuben’ bete ahi uhi; amate mi tul sawmli le tulthum le zasagi le sawmthum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale Pallu’ tapa Eliab ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eliab’ tapa teng pen: Nemuel, Dathan, le Abiram ahi uhi. Tam Dathan le Abiram pen Korah tawh kipawlin Topa a na langdo lai-un Moses le Aaron langdo dinga mihonte lah pana na kiteel Dathan le Abiram tegel ma ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />lei in a kam kahin Korah tawh amate val tumin amau’ pawl teng a si sieng uhi; mei in zong mi zani le sawmnga a kahtum ciengin amate pen midangte dingin kithuhilna a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Korah’ tapate si lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Simeon’ suon lehlahte: Nemuel pan Nemuel bete; Jamin pan Jamin bete; Jachin pan Jachin bete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zerah pan Zerah bete; Shaul pan Shaul bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam teng pen Simeon bete ahi vua, mimal tul sawmni le tulni le zani pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Gad suonlehlahte: Zephon pan Zephon bete; Haggi pan Haggi bete; Shuni pan Shuni bete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ozni pan Ozni bete; Eri pan Eri bete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Arod pan Arod bete; Areli pan Areli bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam teng pen Gad namdangte ahi vua, mimal tul sawmli le zanga pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah’ tapate pen Er le Onan ahi uhi; Er le Onan pen Canaan gamah a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Judah’ suonlehlahte: Shelah pan Shelah bete; Perez pan Perez bete; Zerah pan Zerah bete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Perez-te: Hezron pan Hezron bete; Hamul pan Hamul bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam teng pen Judah bete ahi vua, mimal tul sawmsagi le tulguh le zanga pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Issachar’ suon le hlahte: Tola pan Tola bete; Puvah pan Puvah bete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jashub pan Jashub bete; Shimron pan Shimron bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tam teng pen Issachar bete ahi vua, mimal tul sawmguh le tulli le zathum pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Zebulun suole hlahte: Sered pan Sered bete; Elon pan Elon bete; Jahleel pan Jahleel bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam teng pen Zebulun bete ahi vua, mimal tul sawmguh le zanga pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Joseph’ tapate: Manasseh le Ephraim ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Manasseh’ suonlehlahte: Machir pan Machir bete; Machir pen Gilead’ pa ahi a; Gilead pan Gilead bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tam teng pen Gilead’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi: Iezer pan Iezer bete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asriel pan Asriel bete; Shechem pan Shechem bete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Shemida pan Shemida bete; Hepher pan Hepher bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu-in Hepher’ tapa Zelophehad in tapa nei lo a, hizongle tanu a nei hi. Zelophehad tanute’ min in Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, le Tirzah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tam teng pen Manasseh bete ahi vua, mimal tul sawmnga le tulni le zasagi pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Ephraim’ suonle hlahte: Suthelah pan Suthelah bete; Becher pan Becher bete; Tahan pan Tahan bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Suthelah’ suonlehlahte: Eran pan Eran bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ be zui-a Joseph’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Benjamin suonle hlahte: Bela pan Bela bete; Ashbel pan Ashbel bete; Ahiram pan Ahiram bete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Shephupham pan Shephupham bete; Hupham pan Hupham bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bela’ tapate pen Ard le Naaman ahi uhi: Ard pan Ard bete; Naaman pan Naaman bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ be zui-in Benjamin’ suonlehlahte ahi a, mimal tul sawmli le tulnga le zaguh pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Dan’ suonlehlahte: Shuham pan Shuham bete ahi vua, tam teng pen amau’ be zui-in Dan suonlehlahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Shuham bete zosie: mimal tul sawmguh le tulli le za li pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Asher suonle hlahte: Imnah pan Imnah bete; Ishvi pan Ishvi bete; Beriah pan Beriah bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Beriah’ suonlehlahte: Heber pan Heber bete; Malchiel pan Malchiel bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Asher’ tanu’ min Serah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tam teng pen Asher bete ahi vua, mimal tul sawmnga le tulthum le zali pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in Naphtali’ suonle hlahte: Jahzeel pan Jahzeel bete; Guni pan Guni bete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jezer pan Jezer bete; Shillem pan Shillem bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ be zui-in Naphtali mite ahi vua, amate a kisimna ciengin tul sawmli le tulnga le zali pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tam teng pen a kisim Israel mi phaza hi a, tul zaguh le tulkhat le zasagi le sawmthum pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“Mi phaza tawh kizui-in a luo dingun tam mite tungah leitang kihawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Minam tamte gouluo a tam na pie ding a, minam tawmte gouluo a tawm na pie ding hi. Minam zosie a mi phaza tawh kizui-in gouluo kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ahi vangin leitang pen aisanna tawh kihawm ding a, amau’ be min zui-in a luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Aisanna tawh kizui-in a tamte tungah a tam, a tawmte tungah a tawmin a gouluo uh kihawmpieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Amau’ be zui-in a kisim Levi’ suonlehlahte: Gershon pan Gershon bete; Kohath pan Kohath bete; Merari pan Merari bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tam teng pen Levi’ bete ahi uhi: Libni bete, Hebron bete, Mahli bete, Mushi bete, le Korah bete ahi uhi. Tu-in Kohath pen Amram’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Amram’ zi min pen Levi sung pan Egypt gama a suoh Levi’ tanu Jochebed ahi hi. Tua nu in Amram tawh Aaron, Moses, le a sanggamnu uh Miriam nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Aaron’ tate pen Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, le Ithamar te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Hinanle Nadab le Abihu pen Topa mai-ah mei siengtho lo tawh biehna a pieh lai-un a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Pasal poma hla khat pana tungsie, amau’ sung pan a kisimte tul sawmni le tulthum pha uhi. Azieh pen Israel-te lahah amaw tanh kipie lo ahi ziehin Israel-te lahah amahaw kisimton lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tam teng pen Moses le siempu Eleazar in Moab zanglei, Jordan gun gei Jericho gala a sim mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tam teng lahah Moses le siempu Aaron in Sinai senel gama a simsa uh Israel-te khat zong kihal nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in, “Senel gamah amate a si ding uhi,” a na cisa ahi hi. Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb le Nun’ tapa Joshua simlo amate khat beh om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph’ tapate sung panin Manasseh’ tapa Machir, Machir’ tapa Gilead, Gilead’ tapa Hepher, Hepher’ tapa Zelophehad’ tanute a nai-ah a pei uhi. A tanute’ min pen: Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, le Tirzah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate, Moses le siempu Eleazar mai, makaite mai le mihon zosie mai, kikhopna buh tunkotah a ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pa uh gamlah ah a si hi; Korah tawh kipawlin Topa langpanga a kikhawmte lahah ama a kihal kha sih hi, ahi vangin ama’ mawna zieha si ahi bo hi; ama in tapa a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in tapa a nei lo ziehin bang dingin a be sung panin ka pa uh’ min kiphiet talawm ding ahei? Ka pa sanggamte lahah ka luo ding uh ei pie un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses in Topa mai-ah amau’ thu a tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zelophehad’ tanute thugen a dih ahi hi. A pa uh’ sanggamte lahah amate zong gamh na pie ding a, a tung vuah a pa uh’ gamh na tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel-te tungah, ‘Pasal khat tapa nei loin a si leh ama’ gamh a tanu na luosah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in tanu a nei sih leh ama’ gamh a sanggam pasalte na luosah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in sanggam pasal a nei sih leh ama’ gamh pen a pa’ sanggam pasalte na luosah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pa in sanggam pasal a nei sih leh ama’ gamh pen a be sunga a sanggam kinaipi pen na pie ding vua, ama in tua gamh a tang ding hi,’ ci-in na gen ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Abarim muol vumah kato inlen, Israel-te tunga ka pieh leitang en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na mu zaw ciengin na sanggampa Aaron ma bangin nang zong na mite kung na zuon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen Zin senel gamah keima le mihonpite ka kihau lai-un ka thugen nei langpang uhi. Nang in amau’ mitmu-in tua tuite-ah ka siengthona na lah sih hi. (Tam teng pen Zin senel gam, Kadesh gam Meribah tui-a thupiengte ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in Topa hopi-in ama kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mihonte, a cing nei lo tuute a bah lo nadingin mi zosie’ hlagau a uh Topa Pasien in tua mipite lahah a sungtum a pusuoh thei ding, amate a pui ding le a lutpi ding, tua mihonte a uh dingin mi khat se in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in Moses kungah, “A sunga Hlagau nei mipa ahi Nun’ tapa Joshua zawpi inlen ama tungah na khut ngam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siempu Eleazar le mihon zosie mai-ah ama dingsah inlen amau’ muna-ah za pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel mihon zosie in a thu a man thei nadingin thuneina pawlkhat ama na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa mai-ah Urim tawh ama dinga thu a dawhpieh ding siempu Eleazar mai-ah ama a ding ding hi; ama’ thu tawh ama le a oppi Israel-te zosie, le mihon vannuoi pusuoh ding a, ama’ thu ma tawh a sungtum ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa’ thupieh bangin Moses a gamta hi. Ama in Joshua kai-in siempu Eleazar le mihon zosie mai-ah dingsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ama tungah a khut ngam a, Topa in Moses tungtawna a gen bangin ama tungah thuneina za a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel-te thupie inlen amau’ tungah tam bangin gen in: Keima dinga mei tawh kihal biehna an, a gimnamtui keima-a’ pen a kise hunin ka kungah nei pieh ding uh phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma in amate kungah, Tami khu Topa tunga na pieh ding uh mei tawh kihal biehna ahi hi, na ci ding hi: Tatsat lo biehna-in nisielin paubang lo kumkhat a pha tuuno ni na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zingmawngin tuuno khat na pie ding vua, khuo a mut ciengin adang tuuno khat na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note in an tawh biehna dingin annel tuituoh ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-sekhat le a kigawi sathau ephah khat’ seli-suo-sekhat zong halin na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam pen Sinai Muol tunga kikipsah, Topa tungah a gimnamtui dinga kitatsatlo-a kipie mei tawh kihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dawn thei biehna pen tuuno khatah hin khat’ seli-suo-sekhat hi ding hi; Topa tunga dawn thei biehna dingin siengtho munah lenggazu-cia pen na sung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuuno adang khat pen zingmawnga a khat ma bangin khuo a mut ciengin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehna tawh na pie ding uhi; note in Topa tungah a gimnamtui dingin mei tawh kihal biehna na lui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sabbath ni-in kum khat a pha, paubang lo tuuno ni le an tawh biehna-in sathau tawh kihal annel tuituoh ephah khat’ sesawm-suo- seni le dawn thei biehna tawh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam pen a kitatsatlo meihal biehna le dawn thei biehnate banah Sabbath siela na bawlbe ding uh meihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na hlate uh a kipat sielin Topa tungah meihal biehna na pie ding vua, bawngtang guol ni, tuutang khat, paubang lo kum khat a pha tuuno apa sagi hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />bawngtang khatah an tawh biehna-in sathau kihal annel tuituoh ephah khat’ sesawm-suo -sethum zong hi ding hi; tuale tuutang khatah an tawh biehna dingin sathau kihal annel tuituoh ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-seni hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuuno zosie adingin an tawh biehna-in sathau kihal annel tuituoh sesawm-suo-sekhat hi ding a, tua khu Topa tungah mei tawh kihal a gimnamtui meihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawngtang khatah dawn thei biehna-in zu hin khat’ alang, tuutang khatah hin khat’ sethum-suo -sekhat, tuuno khatah hin khat’ seli-suo-sekhat hi ding hi. Tami khu kum khat sungin a hla siela meihal biehnate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa tungah mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat kipie ding hi; tua pen kitatsatlo-a meihal biehna le dawn thei biehnate bana kipie ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hla masa a ni sawm le li ni-in Topa’ Peisan Pawi kibawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam hla a ni sawm le nga ni pen pawi bawl ni ahi hi; ni sagi sung tol saw lo an kine ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni masa ni-in siengtho kikhopna khat om ding a, leitung nate na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa tungah meihal biehna-in bawngtangno ni, tuutang khat, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa sagi na pie ding uhi; tuate pen paubang lo hi ding hi, ci thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau’ an tawh biehna pen sathau kihal annel tuituoh hi ding hi: Bawngtang khatah annel tuituoh ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-sethum na pie ding vua, tuutang khatah sesawm-suo-seni hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuuno sagite khatah sesawm-suo-sekhat na pie ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />thoidamna bawl nadingin mawhna zieha biehna-in keel apa khat zong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam teng pen zingmawng tatsatlo-a kibawl meihal biehnate banah na bawlbe ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua bangma-in mei tawh kihal an tawh biehna ahi, Topa tunga a gimnamtui, ni sagi sung ni sielin na pie ding uhi; tatsatlo-a kibawl meihal biehna le dawn thei biehnate banah tuate kipiehbe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in a siengtho kikhopna khat na nei ding uhi; tua ni-in leitung nasepte na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa tungah biehna-in ga masa na pieh ni uh, nipikal pawi sung antha na pieh ni-un a siengtho kikhopna khat na bawl ding uhi; khum ni-in leitung nate na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa tungah a gimnamtui meihal biehna na lui ding vua, bawngtang ano ni, tuutang khat, le kum khat a pha tuuno apa sagi hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amau’ an tawh biehna dingin bawngtang khatah sathau kihal annel tuituoh ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-sethum, tuutang khatah sesawm-suo-seni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />le tuuno sagite khatah sesawm-suo-sekhat ciet na pie ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />note ading thoidamna bawlna-in keel apa khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A tatsatlo-a bawl meihal biehna le an tawh biehnate banah tuate le dawn thei biehna na piehbe ding uhi. Tua teng pen paubang lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hla sagina a ni masa ni-in a siengtho kikhopna khat na nei ding uhi; note in leitung nasepte na sem sih ding uhi. Khum ni pen note dingin pengkul na tum ni ding uh ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa tungah a gimnamtui meihal biehna-in bawngtang ano khat, tuutang khat, le kum khat a pha paubang lo tuuno apa sagi na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An tawh a biehna uh pen sathau kihal annel tuituoh hi ding a, bawngtang khatah ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-sethum, tuutang khatah sesawm-suo -seni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />le tuuno sagite khatah sesawm-suo-sekhat ciet hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />noma ading thoidamna bawl nadingin mawna zieha biehna-in keel apa khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam teng pen hla tha meihal biehna le an tawh biehna, tatsatlo meihal biehna, an tawh biehna, le tuate dinga ngaina a om bangin Topa ading a gimnamtui le mei tawh kihal biehna ahi dawn thei biehnate banah bawlbe lai dingte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tam hla a sagina a ni sawm ni-in a siengtho kikhopna khat na bawlin noma le noma na kideh ding uhi; note in na na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa tungah a gimnamtui meihal biehna-in bawngtang ano khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha tuuno apa sagi na pie ding vua, tuate pen paubang lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An tawh a biehna dingun bawngtang khatah sathau kihal annel tuituoh ephah khat’ sesawm- suo-sethum, tuutang khatah sathau kihal annel tuituoh sesawm-suo-seni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuuno sagite khatah sesawm-suo- sekhat hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />thoidamna bawl nadingin mawna zieha biehna, tatsatlo meihal biehna, an tawh biehna, le dawn thei biehnate banah mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat tawh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note in a hla sagina ni sawm le ni nga ni-in a siengtho kikhopna khat na bawl ding uhi; leitung nasepte na sem sih ding uhi. Topa adingin ni sagi sung pawi na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa tungah a gimnamtui, mei tawh kihal biehna dingin bawngtang ano sawm le thum, tuutang ni, kum khat a pha tuuno apa sawm le ni na pie ding uhi. Tuate pen paubang lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An tawh a biehna dingun bawngtang sawm le thumte khatah ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-sethum, tuutang nite khatah sesawm suo seni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />le tuuno sawm le lite khatah sesawm-suo-sekhat hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tatsatlo meihal biehna, an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate banah mawna zieha biehna adingin keel apa khat zong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ni ni ni-in bawngtang ano sawm le ni, tuutang ni, kum khat a pha paubang lo tuuno apa sawm le li,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a phaza tawh kizui-a a kiciengtan bangin bawngtangte, tuutangte, le tuunote adingin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate tawh kipie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tatsatlo meihal biehna, an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate banah mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat zong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in bawngtang sawm le khat, tuutang ni, le kum khat a pha paubang lo tuuno apa sawm le li,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a phaza tawh kizui-in a kiciengtan bangin bawngtangte, tuutangte, le tuunote adingin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate tawh hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tatsatlo meihal biehna le an tawh biehnate banah mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat zong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ni li ni-in bawngtang sawm, tuutang ni, le kum khat a pha paubang lo tuuno apa sawm le li,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a phaza tawh kizui-in a kiciengtan bangin bawngtangte, tuutangte, le tuunote tawh pieh dingin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate tawh hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tatsatlo meihal biehna, an tawh biehna, le dawnthei biehnate banah mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat zong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ni nga ni-in bawngtang kuo, tuutang ni, kum khat a pha paubang lo tuuno apa sawm le li,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a phaza tawh kizui-in a kiciengtan bawngtangte, tuutangte, le tuunote tawh pieh dingin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate tawh hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tatsatlo meihal biehna le an tawh biehnate banah mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat zong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A ni guh ni-in bawngtang giet, tuutang ni, le kum khat a pha paubang lo tuuno apa sawm le li,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a phaza tawh kizui-in a kiciengtan bawngtangte, tuutangte, le tuunote tawh pieh dingin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate tawh hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tatsatlo meihal biehna, an tawh biehna, le dawn thei biehnate banah mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat zong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in bawngtang sagi, tuutang ni, le kum khat a pha paubang lo tuuno apa sawm le li,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a phaza tawh kizui-in a kiciengtan bawngtangte, tuutangte, le tuunote tawh pieh dingin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate tawh hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tatsatlo meihal biehna, le dawn thei biehnate banah mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat zong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A ni giet ni-in note in kikhopna thupi khat na nei ding uhi; leitung nate na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa dingin a gimnamtui, meihal biehna dingin bawngtang khat, tuutang khat, kum khat a pha paubang lo tuuno apa sagi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />a phaza tawh kizui-in a kiciengtan bawngtang, tuutang, le tuunote tawh pieh dingin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />tatsatlo meihal biehnate banah mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat zong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na kiciemna zieh vua biehnate le nop thu-a na biehnate ban vuah na meihal biehnate uh bangin an tawh na biehnate uh, dawn thei na biehnate uh, le thunuoma na biehnate uh, a kise na pawi hunte vuah tam teng, Topa tungah na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin Moses in Israel-te tungah a unpi-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Israel minam lutangte tungah tam bangin a gen hi: Topa’ thupieh tam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi khat in Topa tungah kiciemna khat a nei cieng ahi a, ama le ama a kikhi nadinga kamciem khat a nei ciengin ahi zongin, ciempel lo ding hi; a kam pana a gingkhie zosie dung zui-in gamta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Numei khangdawng khat in a pa’ inna a op lai-in Topa tungah kiciemna khat a nei ciengin a khangdawn lai, a pa inna a op lai-a kamciemna tawh ama le ama kikhi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a pa in ama le ama a kikhina ahi a kiciemna ahi sihle a kamciem za napi bangma a gen sih leh ama’ kiciemna zosie a kip hi ding hi; tua ciengin ama le ama a kikhina ahi a kamciem zosie zong a kip hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pa in tua thu a zah hunin ama kungah a lungkim lona thu a gen leh, a kiciemna le ama le ama a kikhina ahi a kamciem zong kip lo ding hi; a pa in ama kungah a lungkim lona thu a gen ziehin Topa in tua nu maisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua nu in ama le ama a kikhi nadingin thuciemna a bawl zaw ahi a, ngaisut masah lopi-in a kam tawh a kimawh ciem zaw ahi zongin, pasal a nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuale a pasal in tua thu a zah behin a zi kunga bangma a gen sih leh, tua nu’ kiciemna a kip hi ding a, ama le ama kikhina ahi a kamciem zong a kip hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pasal in tua thu a zah behin a zi kunga a lungkim lona thu a gen leh ama le ama kikhina ahi numei tunga om kiciemna le ngaisut masah lopi-a a hamnate ama in phietpieh ding hi; tuale Topa in tua nu’ mawna maisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(Ahi vangin meigong numei khat ahi a, mi khulsa numei khat ahi zongin ama le ama a kikhina ahi a kiciemna pen ama tungah kip ding hi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in a pasal’ inn ah kiciemna khat a bawl a, ahi sihle ciemtui dawnna khat tawh ama le ama a kikhi leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a pasal in tua thu za napi, ama kungah bangma gen loin ama tunga lungkim lona thu a gen sih leh ama’ kiciemna zosie kip ding a, ama le ama kikhina ahi kamciem zosie zong kip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pasal in tua thute a zah behin a phietpieh leh a kiciemna tawh kisai-in a kam sung pana a ging tapo ahi a, ama’ kamciemna tawh kisaite ahi zongin kip lo ding hi. A pasal in tuate phietpieh zo ahi ziehin tua nu’ mawna Topa in maisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuciemna khatpo ahi a, ama le ama a kiniel nading kikhina kamciem khatpo ahi zongin a pasal in kipsah thei, a pasal in phietmang thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pasal in ni khat zaw ni khat ama kungah bangma a gen sih leh ama in a zi tunga om thuciemna zosie ahi a, a kamciem zosie ahi zongin a kipsah ahi hi; tua teng a zah behin ama kungah bangma a gen lo ziehin ama in tua teng a kipsah zo ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in tua teng a zah zaw-in a nua phiet leh ama’ khielna ama in puo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam teng pen pasal le a zi, le a pa’ inn sunga a nungah a khangdawn lai-a a om a tanu le a pa tawh kisai zui dinga Topa in Moses tunga a thupieh ngainate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in ama kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Midian-te tungah Israel-te’ phu la in; tua zaw ciengin na mipite kung na zuon ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in mite kungah, “Midian-te tungah Topa’ phulahna a sem ding, pei-in Midian-te a do dingin na mite pawlkhat galhiem guon un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel minamte lah panin galdo dingin nam khatah mi tulkhat ta na kuonsah ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel tul tampite lah panin minam khatah tulkhat ta kidong a, gal do dingin mi tul sawm le tulni galhiem kiguon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in amate, minam khatah tulkhat ta, a khut sungah biehinn vanzahte le patau kona pengkulte a tawi siempu Eleazar’ tapa Phinehas tawh galdo dingin a kuonsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin Midian-te a do vua, pasal zosie a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A mi tha uh adangte banah Midian kumpi nga teng: Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur, le Reba a that uhi; amate in Beor’ tapa Balaam zong namsau tawh a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel-te in Midian numeite le a tasente salin a man nuhi; amate in a tuuhonte ule a na zosie uzong galvan lahin a la sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a tenna uh khuopite le a giephuol zosie uh mei tawh a haltum vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ahi vangin gal sunga a mat zosie uh, mihing le ganhingte a peipi sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jericho mun Jordan gei, Moab zanglei giephuola om Moses, siempu Eleazar, le Israel mihonpite kungah a galmatte ule a vanlahte a tut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses, siempu Eleazar, le mihon makai zosie zong giephuol pulamah vai dawn dingin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Galdona pana ang pei mi tul tampi a uhte le mi za tampi a uh galkapmangte tungah Moses lungthah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in amate kungah, “Numei zosie na hinkhawi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam sunga om numeite in Peor vai-ah Balaam’ thuhilna ziehin Topa tungah Israel-te a zuoutatsah vua, tuaci’n Topa’ mihonte lahah gimna a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in nausente lahah pasal poma that unlen, pasal tawh a lumtonsa numei poma zong that un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin pasal tawh a lumton nai lo ngahnuno zosie noma dingin hingkhawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni sagi sung giephuol pulamah om un; mi khat po a that ahi sihle misi luong a thamkha poma in a ni thum ni le a ni sagi ni-in noma le na galmatte uh na kisiensuo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na puon zosie uh, savun tawh kibawl na zosie, keel mul tawh kibawl na zosie le sing tawh kibawl na zosie na siensuo ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Siempu Eleazar in gal sunga kuon galkapte kungah tam bangin a gen hi: “ Topa in Moses a thupieh thukham ngaina tami ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kham, ngun, sumngo, sia, langva, le hangeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />mei a do zo poma mei-ah kihalin a sieng hi ding hi. Ahi vangin siensuona tui tawh zong kisiensuo ding hi; tuale mei a do zo lo poma tui tawh kisiensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in na puonte uh sawpin a siengtho na hi ding uhi; tua zaw ciengin giephuol ah na pei thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in ama kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nangma, siempu Eleazar, le mihonte’ pupa innkuon lutang teng in gal sunga kiman teng, mihing le ganhing, a ni-in sim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gal van kingate khen ni suo unlen, gal kuon galhangte le mihonte hawmpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa’ sieh dingin gal a kuon galhangte’ satanh panin mihingte, bawngtangte, laate, tuuhonte ahi sihle keelte zanga ciengin khat ta tuomkoi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua lah panin alang la-in Topa tunga biehna dingin siempu Eleazar tungah pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel-te’ nga alang sung panin mihingte, bawngtangte, laate, tuuhonte ahi sihle keelte-ganhing zosie- sawmnga ciengin khat ta la-in Topa’ biehbuh a kem Levi-te tungah na pie ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin Moses le siempu Eleazar in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Galkapte in a lah zaw ciengin vanlah a omlaite a gawmin: Tuutang tul zaguh le tul sawmsagi le tulnga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />bawng tul sawmsagi le tulni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />laa tul sawmguh le tulkhat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />le pasal tawh a lumton nai lo ngahnuno a unpi-in tul sawmthum le tulni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Gal kuonte’ nga ahi tanh alang pen tuu tul zathum le tul sawmthum le tulsagi le zanga hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa’ sieh ding pen tuu zaguh le sawmsagi le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bawng tul sawmthum le tulguh hi a, tua lah panin Topa’ sieh ding pen sawmsagi le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Laa tul sawmthum le zanga hi a, tuate lah panin Topa’ sieh ding pen sawmguh le khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mihing tul sawm le tulguh hi a, tuate lah panin Topa’ sieh ding pen mihing sawmthum le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin Moses in siempu Eleazar tungah Topa bieh nading siekaih a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Galkapte tung panin Moses in Israel-te tanh dinga a khenkhiet alang teng ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />mihonte’ tanh alang teng pen tuu tul zathum le tul sawmthum le tulsagi le zanga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />bawng tul sawmthum le tulguh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />laa tul sawmthum le zanga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />le mihing tul sawm le tulguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Moses in Israel-te’ nga alang sung panin mihing le ganhing sawmnga ciengin khat ta la a, Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin Topa’ biehbuh a kem Levi-te tungah a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ciengin galkap a tul tampite tunga uliente ahi, tul tampi a uhte le za tampi a uhte, Moses kungah a pei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Ko na nasemte in ka uhna nei vua om galhangte ka sim zo ta vua, khat zong a pelem ka om sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Topa mai-ah kote dinga thoidamna bawl nading, Topa’ biehna dingin kham tawh kibawl nate, banbulte le tauciente, min gielna khutsipte, bilbate, le khite, ka mu ciet uh kang tawi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Moses le siempu Eleazar in amate tung panin khutsiemna tawh kibawl kham zosie a sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A tul tampi a uhte le a za tampi a uhte tung pana kinga Topa’ tunga a pieh uh khamte a unpi-in shekel tul sawm le tulguh le zasagi le sawmnga gih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />(Galkapte in amate ading ciet van a kilah uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses le siempu Eleazar in a tul tampi le a za tampi a uhte’ tung panin khamte a sang vua, Topa mai-ah Israel-te a kiphaw nadingin kikhopna buh sungah a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Reuben-te le Gad-te in ganhon tampi a nei uhi. Jazer gam le Gilead gam pen gan khawi nadingin a hoi lam a mu ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gad-te le Reuben-te pei-in Moses, siempu Eleazar, le mihon makaite hopi-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ataroth, Dibon, Jazer, Nimrah, Heshbon, Elealeh, Sebam, Nebo, le Beon-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mihonte mai-ah Topa in a na lah gamte pen gan cinna gam hoi ahi hi; na nasemte in gan ka nei uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in, “Na muna-ah maipha ka nga uleh na nasemte’ luo dingin tami gam ei pie in; Jordan gal ei kaisah da mai in,” a cibe lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in Gad-te le Reuben-te kungah, “Note tam munah to ziuzieu-in na sanggamte gal sima kuon ding ahi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in a piehsa gam a pei nading vuah Israel-te bang dinga lungkiesah dinga kisa na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kadesh-barnea panin gam van dingin ka sawl lai-in na pu na pate un tam bang ma ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eshcol Kuom tungto-in tua gam a mu ciengun, Topa in a piehsa gam a pei nading vuah Israel-te a lungkiesah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khum ni-in Topa lungthahna kikuontaw a, tuale kiciemin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Amate in a lungsim tahpi utawh kei ei zui lo uh ahi ziehin Egypt gam pana ang peito mite lah panin kum sawmni pan a tungsie koima khat beh in Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tungah pieh dinga ka ciem gam-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kenaz mi Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb le Nun’ tapa Joshua-te longal in a mu sih ding uhi, azieh pen amahawn lungsim tahpi tawh Topa a zui sih uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel-te tungah Topa’ lungthahna kikuontaw a, Topa mai-ah sietna a bawl tua khangmi zosie a manthai sieng masangsie-un, gamlahah amate kum sawmli sung vaivasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />No mawneite’ suonte, na pu na pate uh’ tangin Israel-te tungah Topa’ a huoisie lungthahna a pungsah dinga ang khang na hi uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama zui loin na piel uleh ama in gamlah-ah amate nuasiekia ding hi; note na hi uleh tam mi zosie a susie na hi ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah a pei vua, “Ka gante vua dingin tuuhuong bawlin ka tate vua dingin khuo ka sat ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ahi vangin a tun nading mun uh amate ka tut masangsie-un, Israel-te mai-ah galhiem tawi-in a madawhin ka pei ding uhi. Tua kikal sungin tam gama a teng mite ziehin ka naupangte uh kul tawh ki-im khuopite sungah a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel-te zosie in a luo ding uh a nga sieng masangsie-un ka inn vuah ka kinuale sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jordan galkhat le a bansie pen amate tawh ka luoton sih ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile tam lam gal Jordan nisuona lam teng pen kohaw’ luo ding ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in a kung vuah, “Tam bangin note gamta-in, gal do dingin galhiem tawi-in Topa mai-ah na pei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ama in a mai panin a galte a nawdawh masang galhiem a tawi nohaw zosie in Topa mai-ah Jordan gun na galkai vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa mai-a leitang a kilah masangsie - Topa tung le Israel-te tungah na sep ding teng uh a zo suohin na kilekia thei ding vua, tam leitang pen Topa mai-ah noma’ neisa ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanle tami na bawl sih uleh Topa tunga a khiel zo na hi ta vua, na khielna un ang sulzui ding khu kitheitel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na naupangte vua dingin khuopite sat unlen, na gante vua dingin tuuhuong bawl un; ahi vangin na kamciemsa bangun bawl un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gad-te le Reuben-te in Moses kungah, “Ka pu uh’ thupieh bangin na nasemte ka gamta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka naupangte uh, ka zite uh, ka tuuhonte uh, ka ganhon zosie uh pen Gilead gam khum munah a om suoh ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />hinanle ka pu ei thupieh bangin na nasemte in galhiem tawi-in Topa ading gal sim dingin ka galkai ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate tawh kisai-in Moses in siempu Eleazar, Nun’ tapa Joshua, le Israel minamte’ pupa innkuon lutang teng tungah thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in a amate kungah, “Gad-te le Reuben-te, galvante silin gal sim dingin Topa mai-ah a kithawisa poma in note Jordan gun hing galkaipi-in na mai vuah gal ang zawpi ding vua, tua ciengin note in zong amau’ nei dingin Gilead gam na pie ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ahi vangin note tawh hiem tawi-in a galkai sih uleh zong Canaan gam sunga note lahah gam nga veve ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gad-te le Reuben-te in a dawngkia vua, “ Topa gensa bangin na nasemte tungah ka gamta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hiem tawi-in Topa mai Canaan gam ka galkai ding vua, ahi vangin kohaw’ luo ahi ka neisa uh pen Jordan tam lam pangah a om ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moses in Gad-te, Reuben-te, le Joseph’ tapa Manasseh minam alangte tungah, Amor kumpi Shihon’ gam le Bashan kumpi Og’ gam, a gamsung le a khuopite, a gamgi huop sunga khuopi zosie tawh amate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gad-te in Dibon, Ataroth, Aroer,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Atroth-shophan, Jazer, Jogbehah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Beth-nimrah, le Beth-haran, kul tawh ki-im khuopite, le tuuhuongte a lamkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Reuben-te in Heshbon, Elealeh, Kiriathaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nebo, le Baal-meon (min pawlkhat kikhel), le Sibmah khuopite a lamphakia uhi; a lamphat uh khuopite min tha a phuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Manasseh’ tapa Machir’ suonlehlahte, Gilead-ah pei-in tua gam a la vua, khum sunga om Amor-te a suonmang uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />tuaci’n Moses in Manasseh’ tapa Machir tungah Gilead pie a, khum munah ama a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Manasseh’ tapa Jair pei-in a khuotate uh la a, tuate Havvoth-jair ci-in min a phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Nobah pei-in Kenath le a khuotate la a, ama’ min tapin Nobah a phuoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses le Aaron makaina tawh Egypt gam pan Israel-te a honin a pei lai-un, galkap kivaipuoh dan tawh a khuolzinna uh mun teng pen tam teng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses in Topa’ thupiehna tawh phuol khat pan phuol khat a amau’ kipatna munte a giel hi. Tam teng pen amau’ kipatna mun tawh kizui-in a giephuolte uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hla masa, tua hla ni sawm le ni nga ni-in Rameses panin a dingkhie uhi; peisan pawi a manzaw a zing ni-in Egypt-te’ mitmu-in Israel-te hangsan tahin a peikhie vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in amate lahah a satlia a tacil uh zosie Egypt-te in a vui laitah uh ahi hi. Topa in a pasien-te uh tung nangawnah thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Rameses pan Israel-te ding khie-in Succoth-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Succoth pan ding khie-in senel gam mong Etham-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Etham panin amate dingkhie-in Baal-ephon tawh kimaingat Pi-hahiroth lamah a kiheikia uhi; amate in Migdol mai-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pi-hahiroth pan dingkhie-in tuipi kantanin senel gamah a pei vua, Etham senel gamah nithum sung lamah pei-in Marah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Marah pan dingkhie-in Elim a tung uhi; Elim-ah tuinah sawm le ni le lutu kung sawmsagi om a, khum munah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elim panin a dingkhie vua, amate in San Tuipi gei-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />San Tuipi pan a ding khie vua, Sin senel gamah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sin senel gam pan amate a dingkhie vua, Dophkah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dophkah pan amate dingkhie vua, Alush-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Alush pan a ding khie vua, mite dawn ding tui a om lona Rephidim-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rephidim pan a dingkhie vua, Sinai senel gamah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sinai senel gam pan a dingkhie vua, Kibroth-hattaavah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kibroth-hattaavah pan a dingkhie vua, Hazeroth-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hazeroth pan a dingkhie vua, Rithmah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rithmah pan a dingkhie vua, Rimmon-perez-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rimmon-perez pan a ding khie vua, Libnah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Libnah pan a dingkhie vua, Rissah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rissah pana dingkhie vua, Kehelathah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kehelathah pan a dingkhie vua, Shepher Muol ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Shepher Muol pan a dingkhie vua, Haradah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Haradah pan a dingkhie vua, Makheloth-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Makheloth pan a dingkhie vua, Tahath ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tahath pan a dingkhie vua, Terah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Terah pan a dingkhie vua, Mithkah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mithkah pan a dingkhie vua, Hashmonah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hashmonah pan a dingkhie vua, Moseroth-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moseroth pan a dingkhie vua, Bene-jaakan-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bene-jaakan pan a dingkhie vua, Hor-haggidgad-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hor-haggidgad pan a dingkhie vua, Jotbathah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jotbathah pan a dingkhie vua, Abronah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Abronah pan a dingkhie vua, Ezion-geber ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ezion-geber pan a dingkhie vua, Zin senel gam ah giephuol a sat uhi (tua khu Kadesh mun ahi hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kadesh pan a dingkhie vua, Edom gammong-Hor Muol ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Egypt pan Israel-te a peikhiet zaw uh a kum sawmlina, a hla ngana, a ni masa ni-in Topa’ thupiehna tawh Hor Muol tungah siempu Aaron kato a, khum munah a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hor Muol tungah Aaron a si laitahin kum za le kum sawmni le kum thum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Canaan gam Negeb-a a teng Canaan mi Arad kumpipa in Israel-te ang pei hi ci thu a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hor Muol panin a dingkhie vua, Zalmonah-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Zalmonah pan a dingkhie vua, Punon-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Punon pan a dingkhie vua, Oboth-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Oboth pan a dingkhie vua, Moab gam sung Iye-abarim ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Iyim pan a dingkhie vua, Dibon-gad ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Dibon-gad pan a dingkhie vua, Almon-diblathaim-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Almon-diblathaim pan a dingkhie vua, Nebo tun masang Abarim muolte-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Abarim muolte pan dingkhie-in Moab zanglei Jordan gungei Jericho-ah giephuol a sat uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />amate in Jordan gei Beth-jeshimoth panin Moab zanglei-a om Abel-shittim dongin giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Moab zanglei Jordan gungei Jericho khuo-ah Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Israel-te hopi inlen a kung vuah tam bangin gen in: Jordan gun kansanin Canaan gam na tun ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />na mai panun tua gama a teng zosie notmang sieng unlen, a suong milim zosie uh suhsiet piehin, a kisung a milimte uh na susie ding vua, a munsang zosie uh na phelmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Khum gam pen na nei ding vua kang pieh ahi ziehin tua leitang note in tang unlen a sungah teng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Na be na phung utawh kizui-in aisanna tawh tua leitang na hawm ding uhi; mici tamte a golzaw pie-in mici tawmte a neuzaw na pie ding uhi; mi khatpo tunga ai a tuhna popo ama-a’ hi pai ding hi; na be na phung sung vua na pate uh nam tawh kizui-in khum gam na luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ahi vangin na mai panun khum gama a na tengsa mite na nawmang sih uleh, na opsah lai uh mite pen note dingin na mit uh ang do, na pang uh ang sun ling tawh a kibang ding uhi; amate in na tenna gam vuah ang lung gimsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Amate tungah bawl dinga ka ngaisut bangin na tung vuah kang bawl ding hi, ci-in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-te thupie inlen a kung vuah tam bangin gen in: Canaan leitangah na lut ciengun (Canaan gam, na luo ding vua gamgi hielsa a kang piehte tam teng ahi hi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />na leitaw lampang uh pen Zin senel gam panin Edom pang teng hi ding hi. Na leitaw lam gamgi uh pen nisuona lamah Si Tuipi mong pan kipan ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />na gamgi uh Akrabbim katona leitaw lamah kawi-in Zin kansan ding a, a mong tawpna pen Kadesh-barnea leitaw lam hi ding hi; tua ciengin Hazar-addar dong pei suohin Azmon kansan ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azmon panin Egypt Lui lamah gamgi kawi-in Tuipi-ah tawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nitumna lam gamgi dingin Tuipi Lien le tua ’ gun dung teng na tang ding uhi; tam pen nitumna lam na gamgi uh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leilu lam na gamgi uh tam hi ding hi: Tuipi Lien panin Hor Muol dong na gamgi uh na ciemte ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hor Muol panin Lebo-hamath dong na ciemte ding vua, gamgi mong in Zedad dong ban ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua ciengin Ziphron dong gamgi kihlung ding a, a mong pen Hazar-enan ah tawp ding hi. Tami khu leilu lam na gamgi uh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nisuona lam na gamgi uh Hazar-enan panin Shepham dong na ciemte ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />gamgi pen Shepham panin Ain nisuona pang lama om Riblah dongah peisuh ding a, tua gamgi peisuhin Chinnereth tuipi nisuona lam gamken dong bansuh ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jordan dongin gamgi peisuh ding a, a mong pen Si Tuipi ah tawp ding hi. Tam pen a kimvela gamgi nei na gam uh hi ding hi, ci-in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses in Israel-te thupie-in tam bangin a gen hi: Tam pen minam kuo le minam alangte tungah pieh dingin Topa in a thupieh, aisanna tawh na luo ding uh leitang ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />azieh pen Reuben minamte, amau’ innkuonte, le Gad minam amau’ pupa innkuonte in a gouluo uh a la zo ta vua, Manasseh minam alangte in zong a la zo ta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minam ni gel le minam alangte in a gouluo dingun nisuona lam, Jordan gal Jericho nisuona lam teng a la uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na luo ding uh leitang ang hawmpieh dingte min pen siempu Eleazar le Nun’ tapa Joshua-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na luo ding uh leitang hawm dingin minam simah makai khat ta na la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ min ahi hi: Judah minam sung panin Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Simeon minam sung panin Ammihud’ tapa Shemuel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin minam sung panin Chislon’ tapa Elidad ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan minam sung panin makai khat, Jogli’ tapa Bukki ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joseph’ tapate sung panin: Manasseh minam makai khat, Ephod’ tapa Hanniel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ephraim minam sung panin makai khat, Shiphtan’ tapa Kemuel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jebulun minam sung panin makai khat, Parnach’ tapa Eli-zaphan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Issachar minam sung panin makai khat, Azzan’ tapa Paltiel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asher minam sung panin makai khat, Shelomi’ tapa Ahihud ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Naphtali minam sung panin makai khat, Ammihud’ tapa Pedahel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam teng pen Israel-te adingin Canaan gamah leitang hawm dinga Topa in thu a pieh mite ahi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jericho khuo Jordan gun gei Moab zanglei-ah Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in luo-in a nei ding uh sung panin Levi-te a sunga a ten nading khuopite a pieh nadingun Israel-te thu pie in; khuopite kimvela lonona mun teng zong Levi-te na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuopite pen amau’ tenna hi ding a, lonona munte zong amau’ tuuhonte le bawnghonte, amau’ ganhonte le amau’ ganta zosie-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Levi-te na pieh ding uh khuopi lonona munte in khuopi kul panin a kimkot tong tulkhat huom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khuopi pulam te inlen nisuona lampang tong tulni, leitaw lampang tong tulni, nitumna lampang tong tulni, leilu lampang tong tulni hi ding a, a laikimah khuopi om ding hi; tam pen amau’ khuopi lonona munin a nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Levi-te na pieh uh khuopite sungah kibuhna khuopi guh kihal ding a, khum munah mi thatpa na taisah ding vua, tua banah khuopi sawmli le ni na piehbe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levi-te na pieh ding uh khuopi zosie a unpi-in sawmli le giet hi ding a, lonona gamte tawh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel-te’ neisa lah panin na pieh ding uh khuopite tawh kisai-in, mi citamte tung panin tampitah na la ding uhi; mi citawmte tung panin tawmkhat beh na la ding uhi. Amau’ luo gamh tawh kizui-in Levi-te tungah a khuopite uh a pie ciet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel-te hopi inlen a tung vuah tam bangin gen in: Jordan galkai-in Canaan gam na tun ciengun, sawm lopi-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />khum munah mi khat a thatkha pa a tai thei nading, noma ading kibuhna khuopi dingin khuopite na tel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihonpite mai-ah thukhenna a thuoh masangin, tua mithatpa a si lo nadingin khuopite pen phula pa kung pana na kibuhna uh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noma adinga na ciemte uh khuopite ahile khuopi guh hi ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kibuhna khuopi dingin Jordan galkhatah khuopi thum, Canaan gam sungah khuopi thum na ciemte ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sawm lopi-in mi khat a that khate khum munah a tai thei nadingin tam khuopi guhte pen Israel-te, note lahah a teng gamdang mite ahi sihle bakhat sung a peemte adingin kibuhna hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi khat in sia vanzah khat tawh midang khat satin tua mipa a si leh ama tuolthat ahi hi; tua tuolthat pa kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi sihle mi khat in mi si thei nading ahi a khut sunga a tawi suong tawh midang khat sepin a si leh, ama tuolthat ahi hi; tua tuolthat pa kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi sihle mi khat in mi a si thei nading ahi sing tawh kibawl hiem khat tawh midang khat satin a si leh, ama tuolthat ahi hi; tua tuolthat pa kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua tuolthat pa pen sisan phulapa in that ding hi; ama gel a kimu ciengun sisan phulapa in tuolthat pa that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ma bangin mudana ziehin mi khat in adang khat sawnpua-in, ahi sihle na buhdapin bangkhat tawh khaw-in a si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tua ahi sihle kigalbawlin a khut tawh tumin tua mipa a si leh, tua mitum pa kithat ding hi; tua mipa pen tuolthat ahi hi; ama gel a kimu ciengin sisan phulapa in tuolthatpa that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin kigalbawlna om lopi-in midang khat thakhatin sawnpua-in, ahi sihle buhdap loin bang khat tawh sepin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ahi sihle si thei nading suongtum khatpo tawi-in, a galte zong hi beh lo, suhliem zong sawm lo hi tama le sawm lopi-in midang khat tungah tua suongtum in khieh kha-in tua mipa a si leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />mi honpite in tuolthat pa le sisan phulapa’ kikalah tam ngaina kipte tawh kituohin thu khen ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />sisan phula pa khut sung panin mihonpi in tuolthat pa hunkhie ding uhi. Tua ciengin a kibuh masahna khuopi-ah tuolthat pa puohkia ding uhi. Sathau siengtho kinu siempu lien pa a si masangsie tua khuo-ah tuolthat pa a teng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuolthat pa in hun khatpo-ah a buhna masa khuopi’ gamgi kansanin a pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />sisan phula pa in a kibuhna khuopi pulamah ama mukha-in phula pa in tua tuolthat pa a tha leh, ama in sisan suona ziehin mawna a puo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Azieh pen siempu lien pa a si masangsie tua mipa pen kibuhna khuopi sungah a om ding hi; ahi vangin siempu lien pa a si zaw ciengin tuolthat pa inn ah pei thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam teng pen na khang tawntung vua na tenna uh mun zosie-ah thukham le ngaina kipte hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi khat in midang khat a tha leh tecite’ theina siasanin tuolthat pa kithat ding hi; ahi vangin teci khat beh’ tecipanna tungtawnin koima khat beh kithat lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua banah sina dan thuoh dinga kilawm mipa khat a kitatna ding sum na sang sih ding uhi; tuolthat pa kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kibuhna khuopi-a a taisa mi khatpo, siempu lien pa a si masangin kilekia-in gam sungah a ten thei nadingin kibuhna khuopi-a galtai pa kitat nading sum na sang sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na tenna uh leitang na buasah sih ding uhi, sisan in leitang buasahin a sisan suohsah pa’ sisan longal tua leitang siensuo thei ding adang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na tenna uh leitang na buasah sih ding vua, keima’ tenna leitang zong na buasah sih ding uhi; azieh pen keima Topa Israel-te lahah ka teng hi, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joseph’ suon Manasseh, Manasseh’ tapa Machir, Machir’ tapa Gilead, Gilead’ suon pupa innkuon lutang teng in nai-in Moses le Israel-te’ pupa innkuon lutang teng mai-ah a hopi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Aisanna tawh Israel-te luo ding leitang a pieh nadingin Topa in ka pu thu a pie hi; a tanute tungah ka sanggampa uh Zelophehad’ gamhluote a pieh nadingin Topa in ka pu thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel minam dangte’ tapate khat penpen tawh a kinun uleh ka pate uh’ gamhluo panin amau’ gamhluo teng kila ding a, a pasal neina uh minamte’ gamhluo-ah kigawm in; tuaci’n ka ngasa uh gamh lah panin kilakhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel-te’ jubilee a tun ciengin amau-a’ teng a pasal neina minamte tungah kigawm ding hi; ka pate uh’ gamhluote lah panin amau’ gamhluo kilakhie ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Topa genna dung zui-in Israel-te thu pie a, “Joseph’ suonlehlahte’ thugente a dih ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam pen Zelophehad’ tanute tawh kisai-in Topa’ thupieh hi a, ‘Hoi a sah pente utawh kinung uheh; ahi vangin a kinunpi ding uh pen a pa uh’ be le phung mite beh hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaci’n phung khat pan adang phung khatah Israel-te’ gamh kituon thei lo ding hi; azieh pen Israel-te zosie in a pate uh’ gamh a kemcing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel-te zosie in a pate uh’ gamh a tan suoh thei nadingun Israel-te lahah gamhluo ding a nei tanu poma in a pate uh’ be sung panin pasal khat tawh kinung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamh pen phung khat panin adang phung khatah kituon thei lo ding hi; azieh pen Israel minam zosie in amau’ gamh ciet a kemcing ding uhi,’ ci hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin Zelophehad’ tanute gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mahlah, Tirzah, Hoglah, Milcah, le Noah-te, a pate uh’ sanggamte’ tapate tawh kinung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joseph’ tapa Manasseh suonte’ bete tawh kinungin, tuaci’n a pa uh’ minam le be sungah a gamhluo uh om suoh den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam teng pen Moab zanglei, Jordan luigei-a Jericho mun, Israel-te kungah Moses tungtawnin Topa in a gensah thupiehnate le ngaina kipte ahi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
